s://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/e7f27a4ee1c22051feee7573c493fc2c969c09c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/ff455d832ce720b8bbdfe49fa6c424afa3e3adc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T15:17:19Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T15:17:19Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"fix(wireframe): explode anchorless captured blocks via geometry; never fail silently (#54)\n\nA captured block with no source anchor (anchor.file === '''') — DOM rendered by an\nun-instrumented shared/library dist component, or a pending framework mount region\n— keyed \"explode into child blocks\" off anchor.file, so double-clicking it did\nnothing, with no feedback. Anchorless blocks are unavoidable in any real app that\nconsumes a pre-built component library (Annotask transforms source JSX, not\nshipped bundles).\n\n- Explode and the hover child-preview now re-resolve an anchorless block''s live\n  subtree by captured GEOMETRY (new wfElementForRect matches the element whose\n  document-space box fits the block''s originalRect) instead of the durable-anchor\n  lookup, decomposing it into anchorless geometric children.\n- A pending MFE region (single-spa/qiankun/<application> mount with no\n  data-annotask-mfe descendant) is captured as multiple geometric sub-blocks via\n  the same unwrap + content passes instead of one opaque box; empty mounts still\n  emit nothing.\n- A new anchorBoundary bounds the geometric explode''s anchor walk so children\n  resolve DOWN to a real instrumented descendant but never UP to the host-glue\n  mount file (which would otherwise mis-anchor an anchorless block to the wrong\n  source).\n- Every explode failure now sets a visible error in the wireframe header instead\n  of returning silently.\n\nAnchored-block, instrumented-MFE, and non-MFE capture/explode output is\nbyte-identical. Adds bridge rootRect/rootEid capture types and tests for the\ngeometric resolver, pending decomposition, anchor boundary, and feedback paths.","tree":{"sha":"9b78d01e6610f877654e7df505dd1e974fe1ff87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/9b78d01e6610f877654e7df505dd1e974fe1ff87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/ff455d832ce720b8bbdfe49fa6c424afa3e3adc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI="