n to 1 low.\n\n- Bump the one SHIPPED runtime dep: ws ^8.20.0 → ^8.21.0 (the rest of the\n  published package''s deps were already clean).\n- pnpm.overrides force patched versions for the transitive/dev/playground vulns,\n  capped to stay in-major so nothing breaks: shell-quote (critical, webpack\n  tooling), fast-uri, devalue, undici, react-router(+dom), vite, postcss, svelte,\n  js-yaml, qs, uuid, launch-editor, webpack-dev-server, http-proxy-middleware,\n  @babel/core; dompurify override raised to >=3.4.9.\n- Bump the astro playground 5 → 6 (the only fix for its advisories was a major).\n\nRemaining: 1 low — esbuild 0.27.x in BUILD tooling only (tsup / webpack-terser),\nnot a runtime dep of the published package. Forcing esbuild >=0.28.1 breaks the\nshell build (0.28 dropped transforming destructuring to the old browser targets),\nso it''s deliberately left until tsup/vite move their pinned esbuild forward.\n\nBuild + typecheck + 999 tests green; published-package prod deps are clean.","tree":{"sha":"e8e0c90579fa25eba51488d454d2c849d0d632d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/e8e0c90579fa25eba51488d454d2c849d0d632d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/3716e0ff1d43473131b25475182ee4dbf1e3cbea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/3716e0ff1d43473131b25475182ee4dbf1e3cbea","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDM3MTZlMGZmMWQ0MzQ3MzEzMWIyNTQ3NTE4MmVlNGRiZjFlM2NiZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/8dc42178b5acf552deb55d49fc3ec4c5d6d9993c","sha":"8dc42178b5acf552deb55d49fc3ec4c5d6d9993c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/8dc42178b5acf552deb55d49fc3ec4c5d6d9993c"}],"sha":"3716e0ff1d43473131b25475182ee4dbf1e3cbea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/3716e0ff1d43473131b25475182ee4dbf1e3cbea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/8dc42178b5acf552deb55d49fc3ec4c5d6d9993c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:33:11Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:33:11Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"docs: accuracy sweep against current code (remove dangling refs, fix counts)\n\nAudited every doc against the codebase and corrected stale/wrong claims:\n\n- docs/api.md: drop the removed POST /wireframe/draft + /draft/revert routes and\n  the ANNOTASK_RENDER_IN_PLACE flag; add the real design-session/* +\n  wireframe-snapshots/* apply routes; add the session:updated WS event and the\n  annotask_get_binding_classification MCP tool; clarify the default permission is\n  no ceiling (''bypass''); broaden the wireframe_apply source description.\n- docs/architecture.md: remove the deleted budget-cap.ts and draft-edits.ts\n  bullets (replace with the real apply/snapshot modules + wall-clock watchdogs);\n  drop \"Libraries\" as a peer Audit sub-section.\n- AGENTS.md (a stale copy of CLAUDE.md): remove the wireframe/draft endpoints,\n  fix \"Modes (4)/--mode-draw\" → 3, \"63 CSS variables\" → 62, add the\n  binding-classification MCP row, mark section_request legacy, refresh the\n  wireframe_apply row, and add the data-binding/explode gating note.\n- README.md: 27 → 28 MCP tools; qualify byte-exact undo as git-project (non-git\n  = anchor files only).\n- CONTRIBUTING.md: prop_update → component_prop_update (+ text_update,\n  wireframe_direction).\n- docs/cli.md: document the binding-classify command; docs/distribution.md: list\n  the ERROR_FIX/PERF_FIX/WIREFRAME_APPLY playbooks; docs/setup.md: drop stale\n  \"libraries\" audit section.\n- SECURITY.md / CHANGELOG.md: the Host gate covers ALL methods (present tense),\n  not just GET.\n- WIREFRAME_APPLY.md: note data-binding + explode are gated off this release.\n  Skill mirrors regenerated via sync:skills.","tree":{"sh