Skill mirrors regenerated via sync:skills.\n- ci.yml: secret-gated, schedule/dispatch-only live-cli job that runs the\n  apply→write→verify loop against a real CLI.","tree":{"sha":"1d12497b39974a825a4f0eb17ff9bd536cd0b87b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/1d12497b39974a825a4f0eb17ff9bd536cd0b87b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/332653e677d481079c2a8922b4af311c4ea908b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/332653e677d481079c2a8922b4af311c4ea908b8","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDMzMjY1M2U2NzdkNDgxMDc5YzJhODkyMmI0YWYzMTFjNGVhOTA4Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/95f44acf652bec45d55aa3fb17439a8ebd1b9d6e","sha":"95f44acf652bec45d55aa3fb17439a8ebd1b9d6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/95f44acf652bec45d55aa3fb17439a8ebd1b9d6e"}],"sha":"332653e677d481079c2a8922b4af311c4ea908b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/332653e677d481079c2a8922b4af311c4ea908b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/95f44acf652bec45d55aa3fb17439a8ebd1b9d6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:24:31Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:24:31Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(wireframe): gate data-binding + explode for the reduced release surface\n\nThis release ships the reduced wireframe surface — capture + sketch + the\nimplement-this-wireframe directions loop — and defers two built-but-not-ready\nareas behind flags in src/shell/wireframeFeatures.ts:\n\n- Data binding (palette/section binding picker, shape drill-down, prop→field\n  map, loop repeat) — deferred while the shape-confidence honesty ladder is\n  reworked.\n- Explode-to-children.\n\nThe code paths stay in the tree and existing persisted bindings still render\nread-only; only the UI entry points are gated (WireframeCanvas, BlockPopover).\nThe e2e specs that exercise binding/explode are skipped/trimmed to match.\n\nAlso: wireframe capture/enter errors now surface in an app-level banner instead\nof flashing and vanishing when the canvas fails to mount.","tree":{"sha":"a34ab9bb5b00df3213e712d3f24d3b4bbb3c5456","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/a34ab9bb5b00df3213e712d3f24d3b4bbb3c5456"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/95f44acf652bec45d55aa3fb17439a8ebd1b9d6e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/95f44acf652bec45d55aa3fb17439a8ebd1b9d6e","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDk1ZjQ0YWNmNjUyYmVjNDVkNTVhYTNmYjE3NDM5YThlYmQxYjlkNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/e3011b1ffd39b0d39e28a035895012d3fab81dbc","sha":"e3011b1ffd39b0d39e28a035895012d3fab81dbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/e3011b1ffd39b0d39e28a035895012d3fab81dbc"}],"sha":"95f44acf652bec45d55aa3fb17439a8ebd1b9d6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/95f44acf652bec45d55aa3fb17439a8ebd1b9d6e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/e3011b1ffd39b0d39e28a035895012d3fab81dbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:24:21Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:24:21Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"fix(apply,agent): close apply/undo lifecycle wedges and harden the embedded-agent loop\n\nApply/undo lifecycle no longer wedges. A crash, abort, restart, orphan\nreconcile, or an agent that pauses at needs_info / is denied used to strand the\nsnapshot batch as ''running'' and entries as ''applying'' — disabling undo, discard\nAND re-apply at once and locking the wireframe canvas at ''building'' forever.\nEvery terminal transition (HTTP + the server-side orphan/boot sweep) now routes\nthrough one shared closure (releaseApplyTask: seal batch + release entries +\nunlock canvas); applyInFlight keys off the always-sealed batch status; retries\nre-stamp entries so review re-verifies.\n\nUndo is byte-exact across the agent''s whole footprint. In a git project the\nengine captures a pre-apply baseline (git stash create) and, at seal, folds\nevery tracked file the agent actually touched into the batch (pre-apply bytes\nfrom git show). Agent-deleted files are recreated on undo (they used to vanish\ndespite a held copy). Non-git projects keep anchor-only coverage.\n\nOther fixes:\n- Anchorless wireframe block (file '''') no longer crashes the apply after minting\n  the task — empty anchors are filtered from the snapshot set.\n- needs_info answers are injected into the agent''s resume prompt (no-MCP loop).\n- Cross-tab 409 (task_already_running) is a benign no-op, not a stream error\n  that reverts the winning tab''s live run.\n- wireframe.json runs through a migration shim before validation, so a future\n  schema bump (or a legacy version-less doc) upgrades instead of silently wiping.\n- Removed the dead BudgetCap module (USD caps aren''t portable across providers;\n  the idle/duration watchdogs are the runaway guard).\n- The dev server prints a loud warning when bound beyond loopback (vite --host).\n\nTests added for the git auto-extend, deleted-file recreation, anchorless apply,\nand the cross-tab 409 path.","tree":{"sha":"6a250dabeb58249cf7922c94911a08a3e83b9a96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/6a250dabeb58249cf7922c94911a08a3e83b9a96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/e3011b1ffd39b0d39e28a035895012d3fab81dbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://av