ail":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(playground): marketing page gets a live data source for the wireframe hero demo\n\n- src/api.js: fetchStats() + fetchChangelog() against the shared FastAPI\n  (/api/marketing/*); fetchChangelog is deliberately unused — it is the\n  binding target for the hero''s drawn ''What''s new'' section\n- hero stats strip renders live installs/stars/contributors/frameworks\n- vite proxy for /api and /openapi.json so the schema scanner resolves\n  shapes (shape_source: ''api-schema'', ChangelogEntry[] at confidence 1)\n- justfile: ''just marketing'' target with ensure-api","tree":{"sha":"61c66002e6ca9a4c0b1994af3ba56de1f2da3934","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/61c66002e6ca9a4c0b1994af3ba56de1f2da3934"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/f1080cdd6330941b5e4c69662fcb132e7f770a8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},