 /planets + restore the straggler fixture\n\nThe accepted /planets redesign collapsed the page to two content blocks\n(page-header + planets-content wrapper), which broke the suite''s old\nheader/toolbar/grid anatomy assumptions — W4''s marquee aliased toolbarBlk\nto headerBlk and could no longer select two blocks. The block picks and\nexpectations now target the two-block anatomy (explode covers the wrapper''s\nlayout/controls children).\n\nThe deleted Button stub was also the suite''s only sibling-of-main element;\na deliberate, styled ''Back to top'' button after <main> replaces it as the\ncanonical straggler-pass fixture (commented as such in App.vue), keeping\nW1''s capture-coverage assertion honest. 6/6 wireframe specs green against\nthe new page.","tree":{"sha":"8c1356b65828866733ef553f54464a4b25f80576","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/8c1356b65828866733ef553f54464a4b25f80576"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/600b513ce7c3cebfc54a2e409892a6822dd6583a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/600b513ce7c3cebfc54a2e409892a6822dd6583a","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDYwMGI1MTNjZTdjM2NlYmZjNTRhMmU0MDk4OTJhNjgyMmRkNjU4M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/c3d5e1c82948ec7e354703483ae763123e16faba","sha":"c3d5e1c82948ec7e354703483ae763123e16faba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/c3d5e1c82948ec7e354703483ae763123e16faba"}],"sha":"600b513ce7c3cebfc54a2e409892a6822dd6583a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/600b513ce7c3cebfc54a2e409892a6822dd6583a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/c3d5e1c82948ec7e354703483ae763123e16faba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T22:17:42Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T22:17:42Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(playground): /planets controls move into a side rail; stray Button removed\n\nApplied end-to-end through the wireframe loop (sketch -> directions ->\nembedded agent -> review -> accept): filters, sort, and the search field\nregroup into an <aside class=\"controls\"> beside the planet layout\n(column-reverse under 900px), and the bare sibling-of-main <Button> stub\nin App.vue is gone — the element the straggler-capture fix was proven on.","tree":{"sha":"02d782ea3598e751b595fd888e8af816c51d5ea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/02d782ea3598e751b595fd888e8af816c51d5ea6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/c3d5e1c82948ec7e354703483ae763123e16faba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/c3d5e1c82948ec7e354703483ae763123e16faba","node_id":"C_