handoff before it.","tree":{"sha":"9d280b24c36574d0580a61f4b0b18b56b2fde733","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/9d280b24c36574d0580a61f4b0b18b56b2fde733"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/c8cebbf247a8e3b64322822ed74a64a07116866d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/c8cebbf247a8e3b64322822ed74a64a07116866d","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGM4Y2ViYmYyNDdhOGUzYjY0MzIyODIyZWQ3NGE2NGEwNzExNjg2NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/d71fbf907bba75fa153a74ac30612fbc89b07b1a","sha":"d71fbf907bba75fa153a74ac30612fbc89b07b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/d71fbf907bba75fa153a74ac30612fbc89b07b1a"}],"sha":"c8cebbf247a8e3b64322822ed74a64a07116866d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/c8cebbf247a8e3b64322822ed74a64a07116866d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/d71fbf907bba75fa153a74ac30612fbc89b07b1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T22:04:37Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T22:04:37Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"fix(wireframe): capture stragglers outside the content root\n\nBlock discovery had exactly two passes — semantic chrome (header/nav/\nfooter/aside) and children of the content root (which starts at <main>) —\nso content mounted as a SIBLING of main that isn''t semantic chrome (a\nfloating button, banner, or toast in layout flow) appeared in the honest\nfull-page ''before'' image but got no block on the canvas: it couldn''t be\nmoved, deleted, or annotated in the sketch.\n\nA third straggler pass walks the capture-root → content-root path and\nblocks every qualifying sibling with a real footprint at each level,\nunless the chrome pass already covers it (containing a chrome block counts\nas covered — blocking the wrapper would double-capture the header inside).\nThe playground''s bare <Button> after <main> (App.vue) is the canonical\ncase, asserted in the W1 e2e (by anchor tag — anchor.file alone would\nfalse-pass, the header chrome block also anchors to App.vue via attribute\nfallthrough).","tree":{"sha":"1786afce81753e56adbeeb1dfbb8de25250966a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/1786afce81753e56adbeeb1dfbb8de25250966a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/d71fbf907bba75fa153a74ac30612fbc89b07b1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/d71fbf907bba75fa153a74ac30612fbc89b07b1a","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGQ3MWZiZjkwN2JiYTc1ZmExNTNhNzRhYzMwNjEyZmJjODliMDdiMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/c845ce66175bf954bdcf96d9939a2c8f6db915d1","sha":"c845ce66175bf954bdcf96d9939a2c8f6db915d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/c845ce66175bf954bdcf96d9939a2c8f6db915d1"}],"sha":"d71fbf907bba75fa153a74ac30612fbc89b07b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/d71fbf907bba75fa153a74ac30612fbc89b07b1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/c845ce66175bf954bdcf96d9939a2c8f6db915d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T21:33:29Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T21:33:29Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"fix(wireframe): review fixes — 22 confirmed findings from the D1–D6 adversarial pass\n\nBehavior:\n- Canvas keydown gains an input-target guard: typing in the generate panel\n  (or its embedded picker) no longer triggers block hotkeys — Backspace in a\n  prop field was deleting the selected block. mdEditing resets on every\n  selection change (select() + the marquee path); it previously stuck after\n  the editor unmounted, swallowing all canvas keys or committing the draft\n  to the wrong block.\n- DataBindingPicker: monotonic pick token — a slow cold-scan response can no\n  longer land on a newer selection. Root-object shapes: pickedPath starts\n  null (the root''s path IS ''''), so nothing renders falsely picked and the\n  whole-response pick now reaches the fields multi-select.\n- Generator: placeAt/apply close the session synchronously before the upload\n  await (double-click placed duplicate blocks); generate/place/apply respect\n  the building lock and Implement cancels any open session; an edit-mode\n  Apply without regenerating keeps the block''s existing previewProps (they\n  are ''what the user saw rendered'', and nothing was rendered).\n- Regenerate-in-place uploads under a FRESH filename and refcount-deletes\n  the old one: duplicates share the old PNG (overwriting silently changed\n  them) and the 1h snapshot cache masked same-name re-uploads after reload.\n  imageSrc is strictly own-id keyed; duplicates seed their own liveImages\n  entry at duplication time.\n- schemaToShape composes allOf with an explicit object type / sibling\n  properties instead of swallowing the inherited keys (unit-pinned).\n- Directions: a drawn section''s description no longer says ''keep it visibly\n  a placeholder'' (added.md is the contract); a duplicate whose original left\n  the sketch says so honestly instead of claiming a user-sketched box.\n- applyDesignSession numbers ONLY direction entries (badge order can''t drift\n  when placements/legacy edits ride the same task) and claims the composite\n  screenshot only when one actually rode along.\n\nStrip leftovers and docs:\n- stress-test annotate matrix no longer drives the removed tool-draw (it\n  failed serially for all 7 apps); marketing page drops the Drawn-sections\n  card + orphan screenshot; HelpOverlay/README say 62 CSS variables;\n  SKILL.md intro and docs/api.md mark sections/component_move legacy;\n  vue-webpack''s installed skill copies refreshed; dead ''move'' icon removed.\n\nNot fixed (noted): scanApiSchemas'' 60s cache ignores its options (pre-existing,\naffects rung-1 freshness after an optionless scan warms it); the design-session\nPUT validates only the change envelope, so a direct PUT could inject an\nunvalidated added.data (every shell writer validates; agents re-ground anyway).","tree":{"sha":"20fd42dff4f62f093e0a23ea099479f43594149b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/20fd42dff4f62f093e0a23ea099479f43594149b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/c845ce66175bf954bdcf96d9939a2c8f6db915d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/c845ce66175bf954bdcf96d9939a2c8f6db915d1","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGM4NDVjZTY2MTc1YmY5NTRiZGNmOTZkOTkzOWEyYzhmNmRiOTE1ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/a05b1e0528e656dd992c49378c4eaf6caa8812e7","sha":"a05b1e0528e656dd992c49378c4eaf6caa8812e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/a05b1e0528e656dd992c49378c4eaf6caa8812e7"}],"sha":"c845ce66175bf954bdcf96d9939a2c8f6db915d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/c845ce66175bf954bdcf96d9939a2c8f6db915d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/a05b1e0528e656dd992c49378c4eaf6caa8812e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T21:07:41Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T21:07:41Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(wireframe): D6 — add directions carry md + bindings; playbook + live proof\n\nWireframeDirectionChange.added gains md (the user''s VERBATIM markdown spec\nfor a drawn section — never blended with measured geometry; the description\nquotes only its first line) and data (the WireframeDataBinding, cloned plain).\ncomputeWireframeDirections emits both for placeholder AND palette adds with\nan honest description summary (''bind to the composable usePlanets →\nplanets[] (show name, type) [shape: api-schema]''); bare-placeholder output\nis regression-locked byte-stable. The before/after composite renders the\nsection tag, md first line, and binding identity as text in the dashed box —\nnever fabricated pixels (verified by eye on the minted task''s PNG).\n\nWIREFRAME_APPLY.md: the add/component and add/placeholder rules split bare\nvs with-md sections, and a new ''Data bindings on adds'' section spells out\nthe shape_source honesty ladder and the re-grounding protocol\n(annotask_get_data_source_details/_examples always; _api_operation when a\nschema ref exists; needs_info on contradiction; never invent fields).\nentryForTask passes the change whole — verified by a new apply-session\nassertion; directions stay trust-verified.\n\nLive proof (ANNOTASK_LIVE_CLI=1, claude): a third matrix scenario seeds a\nfixture project with a REAL usePlanets composable + PlanetCard and an empty\ncontent section (zero planet names anywhere), hands the agent the bound add\ndirection, and asserts the real import + call + v-for + :name/:type landed,\nNO sample data was fabricated, the composable and card stayed byte-identical,\ntrust-verify flipped written, and undo restored byte-exact source — all 3\nlive scenarios pass. e2e: a section with md + binding implements into ONE\ntask carrying both verbatim (6/6 wireframe specs green).","tree":{"sha":"575fed8ff28002b4f67602eec6551008c3f5296f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/575fed8ff28002b4f67602eec6551008c3f5296f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/a05b1e0528e656dd992c49378c4eaf6caa8812e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/a05b1e0528e656dd992c49378c4eaf6caa8812e7","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGEwNWIxZTA1MjhlNjU2ZGQ5OTJjNDkzNzhjNGVhZjZjYWE4ODEyZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/e64ad963bbabafc9d617925ed57b7cbbdd67a787","sha":"e64ad963bbabafc9d617925ed57b7cbbdd67a787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/e64ad963bbabafc9d617925ed57b7cbbdd67a787"}],"sha":"a05b1e0528e656dd992c49378c4eaf6caa8812e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/a05b1e0528e656dd992c49378c4eaf6caa8812e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/e64ad963bbabafc9d617925ed57b7cbbdd67a787/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:56:29Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:56:29Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(wireframe): D5 — sections become wireframe sketch material; Annotate draw tool removed\n\nThe wireframe placeholder grows into the section concept (one concept, not\ntwo): a drawn box keeps its cheap label-only flow, and gains an on-demand\nmarkdown spec (Write/Preview popover via safeMd; Ctrl+Enter or Save commits,\nplain Enter stays a newline) and a data binding through the D3 picker.\n\"Section\" is a DERIVED affordance — a placeholder with md or data renders\nthe section tag, the clipped md hint, and the binding chip; the validator\ngains the additive md check. setBlockMd/setBlockData persist per-route in\nwireframe.json, so sections survive F5 (proven: 12/12 browser smoke incl.\nthe api-schema drill to planets[] name+type).\n\nThe Annotate tab''s drawn-section tool is stripped per the live-edit/D1\npattern: DrawnSectionOverlay deleted; DrawnSection state, the draw-rect\nplumbing, onSectionSubmit (the ONLY section_request emitter), the\nrestore/eid-resolution/rect-tracking section branches, the ''draw'' interaction\nmode + ''d'' key (stored value degrades to ''interact''), the toolbar button,\nand the --mode-draw theme variable (62-var contract; saved custom themes\ntolerate the stale key by construction). Legacy pending section_request\ntasks stay visible and agent-applicable in the Tasks panel — with the tool\ngone there is no overlay claiming editability. section_request stays in\nTASK_TYPES + SKILL.md as a documented legacy type, now explicitly marked.","tree":{"sha":"f75d805062bfc804928a78e660ab0ea051db1d96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/f75d805062bfc804928a78e660ab0ea051db1d96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/e64ad963bbabafc9d617925ed57b7cbbdd67a787","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/e64ad963bbabafc9d617925ed57b7cbbdd67a787","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGU2NGFkOTYzYmJhYmFmYzlkNjE3OTI1ZWQ1N2I3Y2JiZGQ2N2E3ODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/d0baebc4e20dd65be59854680a78dbb96128336d","sha":"d0baebc4e20dd65be59854680a78dbb96128336d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/d0baebc4e20dd65be59854680a78dbb96128336d"}],"sha":"e64ad963bbabafc9d617925ed57b7cbbdd67a787","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/e64ad963bbabafc9d617925ed57b7cbbdd67a787"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/d0baebc4e20dd65be59854680a78dbb96128336d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:44:05Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:44:05Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(wireframe): D4 — generate-component flow replaces the blind palette drop\n\nDropping or clicking a component in wireframe mode now opens a right-docked\nGenerate panel instead of instantly minting a block: settings (real props vs\npreview samples via the propWidgets widget table), an optional data binding\nthrough the D3 picker (offered automatically when the component looks\ndata-driven, never required), generate (honest preview:component snapshot on\nthe app-true surface, fidelity pill, one-click regenerate), then place — at\nthe remembered drop point (the drag fast path) or by ghost-placing on the\ncanvas (image rides the cursor; Escape backs out; clicks over existing\nblocks place instead of dragging). A gear button on placed palette blocks\nreopens the panel seeded from the block for in-place reconfiguration\n(props/binding/snapshot update under the same block id); bound blocks show\na data chip.\n\nuseWireframeMode grows addPaletteBlock/updatePaletteBlock (the old drop path\nnow routes through them, behavior-identical); useComponentGenerator owns the\nsession state machine with JSON-round-trip clone discipline at every\npostMessage/persist boundary. html/layout-preset drops keep the instant\nplaceholder path; the live-iframe drop path is untouched.\n\ne2e: W2''s drop section drives the panel flow; a new spec binds usePlanets\nthrough the real api-schema shape tree (planets[] -> name, type), survives\nF5, and regenerates in place. Unit: generator state machine incl.\nclone-at-boundary and edit-mode routing.","tree":{"sha":"f3a67be447cd803dde9f58b271856bbbf07fcb8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/f3a67be447cd803dde9f58b271856bbbf07fcb8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/d0baebc4e20dd65be59854680a78dbb96128336d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/d0baebc4e20dd65be59854680a78dbb96128336d","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGQwYmFlYmM0ZTIwZGQ2NWJlNTk4NTQ2ODBhNzhkYmI5NjEyODMzNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/f0d63635e2842803a7a742e7ae620c86309d1636","sha":"f0d63635e2842803a7a742e7ae620c86309d1636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/f0d63635e2842803a7a742e7ae620c86309d1636"}],"sha":"d0baebc4e20dd65be59854680a78dbb96128336d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/d0baebc4e20dd65be59854680a78dbb96128336d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/f0d63635e2842803a7a742e7ae620c86309d1636/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:29:48Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:29:48Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(data): D3 — wireframe data-binding foundation, shape endpoint, picker\n\nWireframeDataBinding (shared/wireframe-types.ts): REAL scanner-catalog\nidentity (kind/name/module/endpoint) + user drill-down (path like\n\"planets[]\", fields) + the shape_source honesty tag (''api-schema'' |\n''source-details'' | ''none''). WireframeBlock gains an optional kind-agnostic\ndata field; isWireframeBlock rejects malformed bindings at the PUT boundary.\n\nGET /__annotask/api/data-source-shape?name&kind&file resolves a catalog\nentry down the honesty ladder (data-source-shape.ts): (1) the entry''s\nendpoint matched against discovered API schemas via resolveEndpoint — the\nalready-deref''d response_schema walks into a DataShapeNode tree\n(schemaToShape: cycle  and GraphQL $type degrade to named ref leaves,\nallOf merges, oneOf/anyOf first object-ish variant, depth-capped);\n(2) regex-inferred return-type hints verbatim with their confidence — never\nexpanded into a tree; (3) honestly nothing. Runtime-promoted entries are\nexcluded (no code identity, no shapes this round). Shell-only — agents\nre-ground via the existing data-source-details / api-operation tools.\n\nDataBindingPicker.vue (ships unmounted until D4/D5): catalog search →\nsource select → expandable shape tree with path pick + field checkboxes\nunder ''api-schema''; verbatim hints + free-text under ''source-details'';\nvisibly-blind free-text under ''none''. Pure logic in utils/bindingShape.ts\n(flattenShape/fieldCandidates/buildBinding, validated before emit).\n\nTests: shared validator depth (wireframe-types.test.ts), walker + ladder\nagainst an OpenAPI fixture incl. cycle refs and ambiguity (offline via\nexplicit apiSchemaFiles), flatten/candidates/build units.","tree":{"sha":"09317de78b922e4a024e65936b39714e5bfe45d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/09317de78b922e4a024e65936b39714e5bfe45d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/f0d63635e2842803a7a742e7ae620c86309d1636","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/f0d63635e2842803a7a742e7ae620c86309d1636","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGYwZDYzNjM1ZTI4NDI4MDNhN2E3NDJlN2FlNjIwYzg2MzA5ZDE2MzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/97b05a95f61938e9920027dc9b3729871a528766","sha":"97b05a95f61938e9920027dc9b3729871a528766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/97b05a95f61938e9920027dc9b3729871a528766"}],"sha":"f0d63635e2842803a7a742e7ae620c86309d1636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/f0d63635e2842803a7a742e7ae620c86309d1636"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/97b05a95f61938e9920027dc9b3729871a528766/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:19:42Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:19:42Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"fix(bridge): D2 — preview:component snapshots on the app''s real surface\n\nThe offscreen preview container and the html2canvas backgroundColor were\nhardcoded to a white card (#ffffff/#111111), which stuck out badly on dark\napps. resolveAppSurface() reads the computed background the app actually\npaints (body first — content sits on it — then html; the opposite order of\ndetectColorScheme''s viewport probe, which is unchanged) and derives a\ncontrast-safe text color from its BT.709 luminance, falling back to a\nscheme-derived pair when both are transparent. readBg() is hoisted out of\ndetectColorScheme so both share it.\n\nFixes every existing consumer for free: wireframe palette drops and the\nComponents page thumbnails. Verified on the dark vue-vite playground — a\ndropped Header snapshot now reads rgb(18,18,18) at every padding corner\n(the app''s #121212), confirmed by eye on the PNG.","tree":{"sha":"0fc44149812130e504161f457e6c701358afc89e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/0fc44149812130e504161f457e6c701358afc89e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/97b05a95f61938e9920027dc9b3729871a528766","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/97b05a95f61938e9920027dc9b3729871a528766","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDk3YjA1YTk1ZjYxOTM4ZTk5MjAwMjdkYzliMzcyOTg3MWE1Mjg3NjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/bffb2e8071bb3fa86807e9e5dda97493b663b320","sha":"bffb2e8071bb3fa86807e9e5dda97493b663b320","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/bffb2e8071bb3fa86807e9e5dda97493b663b320"}],"sha":"97b05a95f61938e9920027dc9b3729871a528766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/97b05a95f61938e9920027dc9b3729871a528766"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/bffb2e8071bb3fa86807e9e5dda97493b663b320/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:16:24Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T20:16:24Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(wireframe): D1 — remove the Reposition tool everywhere\n\nWireframe mode is the only move-things surface now. Strips the tool across\nshell (useRepositionMode deleted; useWireframeCanvas pointer handlers, App.vue\nshield, toolbar buttons, ''reposition'' interaction mode + ''r'' key), bridge\n(resolve:move-source + move:element handlers, ResolveMoveSourceResult/\nMoveElementPayload types), journal (recordMove/MoveChangeRecord; the\ncomponent_move report arm), and theme (--mode-reposition: 64 -> 63 vars,\nmaking CLAUDE.md''s documented 63-var contract true; saved custom themes\ntolerate the stale key by construction).\n\nKept shared dependencies the tool only rode on: dropPositionFor + the drop\nindicator (live palette drop), data-annotask-instance stamping (selection,\ndrop-target refusal, capture exclusion, reapply idempotency), and the\ncontainerEids map — hoisted into useWireframeCanvas because deletePlacement\nunmounts live nodes through it and reapply repopulates it after F5/route\nchange. ComponentMoveChange/component_move stays in the schema + SKILL.md as\na documented legacy type (now with its previously-missing apply rule), no\nlonger emitted.","tree":{"sha":"f1d472b9f69ed041557496b2537109a2d0b79ed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/f1d472b9f69ed041557496b2537109a2d0b79ed2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/bffb2e8071bb3fa86807e9e5dda97493b663b320","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/bffb2e8071bb3fa86807e9e5dda97493b663b320","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGJmZmIyZTgwNzFiYjNmYTg2ODA3ZTllNWRkYTk3NDkzYjY2M2IzMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/1019b60f4be231c84c60b61606d30553174b368d","sha":"1019b60f4be231c84c60b61606d30553174b368d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/1019b60f4be231c84c60b61606d30553174b368d"}],"sha":"bffb2e8071bb3fa86807e9e5dda97493b663b320","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/bffb2e8071bb3fa86807e9e5dda97493b663b320"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/1019b60f4be231c84c60b61606d30553174b368d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T18:58:05Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T18:58:05Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"fix(wireframe): explode keeps the container''s styling as a shell backdrop\n\nDouble-clicking a block visually ''removed the styling'': explode deleted\nthe parent block, and the children only carry their own pixels — the\ncontainer''s background, padding, and the surface BETWEEN children (all\npainted by the parent element) vanished, leaving naked fields floating\non the canvas grid.\n\nThe parent now survives as a SHELL backdrop: the rootEid capture takes\none extra pass of the root''s rect with the captured child blocks\nvisibility-hidden in the html2canvas clone — the container''s own pixels\nwith no ghost children, so dragging a child out reveals clean surface,\nnever a burned-in copy of itself. The shell uploads under a new file id\n(duplicates keep referencing the original pixels), is marked shell:true\n(not explodable again; no explode affordance), and stacks below the\nchildren. When no shell can be captured the parent is removed as before\n— a stale full image would ghost. Playbook notes that container vs\nchild directions mean whole-container moves vs restructuring inside it.","tree":{"sha":"ce81f2685a5032f24813c992990700d35ac48021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/ce81f2685a5032f24813c992990700d35ac48021"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/1019b60f4be231c84c60b61606d30553174b368d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/1019b60f4be231c84c60b61606d30553174b368d","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDEwMTliNjBmNGJlMjMxYzg0YzYwYjYxNjA2ZDMwNTUzMTc0YjM2OGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/602e8b8c5dd6f5db3d8113ac54830e96ce380449","sha":"602e8b8c5dd6f5db3d8113ac54830e96ce380449","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/602e8b8c5dd6f5db3d8113ac54830e96ce380449"}],"sha":"1019b60f4be231c84c60b61606d30553174b368d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/1019b60f4be231c84c60b61606d30553174b368d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/602e8b8c5dd6f5db3d8113ac54830e96ce380449/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T02:53:27Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T02:53:27Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(wireframe): W4 polish — explode, snap, multi-select, nudge, GC, created-file netting\n\nCanvas: double-click (or the header button) EXPLODES a captured block one\nlevel deeper — the durable anchor re-resolves the live element, a rootEid\ncapture rasterizes its children (no redundant full-page pass), and the\nchildren land translated by the block''s canvas delta with their own\nfile:line anchors and live-position diff baselines. Dragging snaps\nedges/centers to neighbors with visible alignment guides (Alt disables;\npure computeSnap helper). Marquee + shift-click multi-select with group\ndrag, group delete/duplicate, and arrow-key nudging (Shift = 10px). The\nchrome bar shows the capture viewport — pick a device preset before\ncapturing to wireframe mobile. Captured-block labels stay distinct via\ncssClass, and the two vue wireframe e2e suites now live in ONE file:\nPlaywright runs separate spec files in parallel workers, and they share\none dev server''s wireframe document.\n\nServer: boot-time GC sweeps .annotask/wireframe-snapshots/ for PNGs no\ndoc references (1h mtime guard; a malformed wireframe.json aborts the\nsweep — an unreadable doc must never read as ''no references''). In git\nprojects, apply batches record the untracked set at snapshot time and\nthe seal nets agent-CREATED files into the batch (sha256 per file) —\nundo/discard delete pristine copies and keep+report user-edited ones;\nnon-git projects degrade silently.","tree":{"sha":"8018567dc1eda37bd7b5a53ce33bd8d1278ba20a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/8018567dc1eda37bd7b5a53ce33bd8d1278ba20a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/602e8b8c5dd6f5db3d8113ac54830e96ce380449","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/602e8b8c5dd6f5db3d8113ac54830e96ce380449","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDYwMmU4YjhjNWRkNmY1ZGIzZDgxMTNhYzU0ODMwZTk2Y2UzODA0NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/c5674606dbdfd3a5d54039013722c34c70f4cf0f","sha":"c5674606dbdfd3a5d54039013722c34c70f4cf0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/c5674606dbdfd3a5d54039013722c34c70f4cf0f"}],"sha":"602e8b8c5dd6f5db3d8113ac54830e96ce380449","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/602e8b8c5dd6f5db3d8113ac54830e96ce380449"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/c5674606dbdfd3a5d54039013722c34c70f4cf0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T02:15:05Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T02:15:05Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(wireframe): W2 canvas manipulation + W3 anchored directions apply\n\nW2 — the sketch becomes freely manipulable: drag (3px threshold, z-bump\non grab), 8-handle resize, soft-delete for captured blocks (the apply\ndiff needs deletion as a fact; an undelete popover restores them), hard\ndelete for sketch material with refcount-guarded snapshot cleanup,\nCtrl+D duplicate (shares the image file; duplicateOf roots at the\noriginal), per-block notes (the user-said channel), palette drops as\nhonest preview:component snapshots (canvas-only — no live mount; a\ndata-bound component degrades visibly to a placeholder render), and a\ndrawn labeled placeholder tool. Mutations persist with a trailing\ndebounce; F5 restores the canvas as left. Two real bugs fixed en route:\npalette-drop props were Vue reactive proxies postMessage refused\n(DataCloneError — every drop silently degraded to placeholder), and\nblock discovery unwraps single-child wrappers by HEIGHT, not area, so a\ncentered max-width page column still yields per-section blocks at any\nviewport. Captured blocks carry their first class name — the only\nhuman-distinct label when every block shares one owning component.\n\nW3 — ''Implement this wireframe'' closes the loop: a pure diff engine\nturns the sketch-vs-capture delta into ONE anchored direction per\nchanged block (move/resize/delete/add/note) where relational facts\ncomputed from box geometry (''now above the filters (was below)'') are\nthe contract and pixels are explicitly hints; tool-measured geometry\nand the user''s verbatim notes ride separate schema channels. Adds\nanchor at the nearest surviving captured neighbor. A labeled\nbefore/after composite (numbered badges matching the direction list)\nrides the existing screenshot pipeline. Directions are journal entries,\nso the apply loop is unchanged: route-scoped collection, file snapshots\nbefore the agent runs, ONE wireframe_apply task, byte-exact undo. The\nverifier trusts directions with no source read — spatial outcomes\nverify visually, so resolutions must be specific (playbook rewritten).\nThe canvas locks to the task while building; delete unlocks the sketch\nfor tweak-and-re-implement; accept removes it and shows the real\nimplementation.\n\nProven live: the apply-session matrix seeds the /planets rearrangement\n(grid above filters + pagination placeholder + note) and a real claude\nCLI implemented it in source, trust-verify flipped all directions\nwritten, and revertApplyBatch restored the bytes exactly.","tree":{"sha":"64ddc82ec9fefb635e3979bf04cd2af81f87cda7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/64ddc82ec9fefb635e3979bf04cd2af81f87cda7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/c5674606dbdfd3a5d54039013722c34c70f4cf0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/c5674606dbdfd3a5d54039013722c34c70f4cf0f","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGM1Njc0NjA2ZGJkZmQzYTVkNTQwMzkwMTM3MjJjMzRjNzBmNGNmMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/829c8fdf61f5a8b92293de597da5a4a40ca5503e","sha":"829c8fdf61f5a8b92293de597da5a4a40ca5503e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/829c8fdf61f5a8b92293de597da5a4a40ca5503e"}],"sha":"c5674606dbdfd3a5d54039013722c34c70f4cf0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/c5674606dbdfd3a5d54039013722c34c70f4cf0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/829c8fdf61f5a8b92293de597da5a4a40ca5503e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T01:22:17Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T01:22:17Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(wireframe): W1 snapshot capture + static canvas\n\nWireframe mode freezes the current route into a manipulable image canvas.\nA new wireframe:capture bridge message walks the rendered DOM (semantic\nmain + single-child unwrap; header/nav/footer/aside chrome pass; 24-block\ncap), rasterizes each block sequentially with html2canvas (progress pushes,\nper-block failure stays an honest hatched box), and ends with a scale-1\nfull-document pass — the ''before'' truth for apply-time composites. Block\nPNGs land in .annotask/wireframe-snapshots/ (id-addressed upload, contained\nserve/delete); wireframe.json gains a per-route canvas node (blocks carry\nsource anchors + original rects; validated to block depth at the PUT\nboundary). The canvas renders as an opaque overlay INSIDE #canvas-area —\nthe live iframe stays mounted underneath, so exit is lossless by\nconstruction (e2e proves zero reloads and a PlanetsPage.vue:line anchor\nchip on /planets).","tree":{"sha":"22560013366fcb2e5bb3703e0e5389a9b221b531","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/22560013366fcb2e5bb3703e0e5389a9b221b531"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/829c8fdf61f5a8b92293de597da5a4a40ca5503e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/829c8fdf61f5a8b92293de597da5a4a40ca5503e","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDgyOWM4ZmRmNjFmNWE4YjkyMjkzZGU1OTdkYTVhNGE0MGNhNTUwM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/eb7f9ad901b79677ea5bcc675ccca8d48799b444","sha":"eb7f9ad901b79677ea5bcc675ccca8d48799b444","url":"