le-prop\npreview widgets extracted to propWidgets. The design-apply e2e seeds the\njournal via the API and proves the panel -> task -> snapshot -> release loop;\nthe react-vite /planets playground page backs capture/canvas e2e to come.","tree":{"sha":"1ff5f3f2ec6bcd4e5ace3ac4898213798abdfc1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/1ff5f3f2ec6bcd4e5ace3ac4898213798abdfc1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/ab33ddccd528fdd382972740ddbdc98a5bb0a9b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/ab33ddccd528fdd382972740ddbdc98a5bb0a9b4","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGFiMzNkZGNjZDUyOGZkZDM4Mjk3Mjc0MGRkYmRjOThhNWJiMGE5YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/153e617e4ab8cf2b5db50733e8d96b99fde15421","sha":"153e617e4ab8cf2b5db50733e8d96b99fde15421","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/153e617e4ab8cf2b5db50733e8d96b99fde15421"}],"sha":"ab33ddccd528fdd382972740ddbdc98a5bb0a9b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/ab33ddccd528fdd382972740ddbdc98a5bb0a9b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/153e617e4ab8cf2b5db50733e8d96b99fde15421/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T00:56:56Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T00:56:56Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"feat(server): design-session journal, file-snapshot engine, and agent-apply loop\n\nThe server half of the snapshot-wireframe apply loop. A design session is an\nordered journal of user edits (.annotask/design-session.json, CAS on rev);\n''Apply now'' snapshots every touched file (byte-exact undo/discard net), mints\nONE wireframe_apply task carrying context.wireframe + context.session, and\nstamps statuses. When the agent flips the task to review, a verification pass\nre-reads source per entry and marks each written|failed. Accept commits the\nsnapshots; delete releases entries back to pending. The file-snapshot engine\nreplaces draft-edits (one-time journal migration included), is hash-guarded\nagainst user edits, and rehydrates across restarts — files revert only via\nexplicit undo/discard. binding-classify stays as agent tooling (MCP + CLI):\nround-trip honesty classification of props/text before an agent rewrites them.","tree":{"sha":"fd6724d7950d2fd7a057acfcf4fd64c2c5e28898","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/fd6724d7950d2fd7a057acfcf4fd64c2c5e28898"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/153e617e4ab8cf2b5db50733e8d96b99fde15421","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/153e617e4ab8cf2b5db50733e8d96b99fde15421","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDE1M2U2MTdlNGFiOGNmMmI1