/api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/5fb0b470461ddb0be8b8e2d0c9fa493d0f49402d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T20:17:22Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T20:17:22Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"Polish toolbar visual quality: unify control system, replace raw glyphs\n\nToolbar previously mixed raw glyph buttons (⟳ Scan page, ⌨ Tab order) with\nLucide-icon buttons elsewhere, ran three different border-radii (4/5/6px),\nthree different paddings (3px 8px, 3px 10px, 4px 10px), and had a divider\nbug where panel-toggle segments with 3+ buttons lost dividers between\nmiddle pills. Inputs used outline:none with no replacement focus ring,\nhurting keyboard accessibility and axe-core compliance.\n\n- Replace ⟳ / ✕ / ⌨ raw glyphs with refresh-cw / x / keyboard Lucide icons\n- Unify all toolbar controls to 26px height and 6px border-radius\n- Fix .panel-toggle divider bug for 3+ segments (was first-child only)\n- Add focus-visible ring (--focus-ring + --accent-muted glow) to route-input,\n  class-editor, new-task-toggle, and a shared toolbar focus selector\n- Bump toolbar height 40→44px for better breathing room\n- Bump tab-badge / toggle-badge font 8-9px → 10px, height 14 → 16px,\n  add tabular-nums for stable counters (better legibility + axe small-text)\n- Add prefers-reduced-motion media query that disables spin/pulse animations\n  and transitions\n- Add .icon-spin keyframe and spinning refresh icon for in-flight scan state\n\nNo new one-off CSS values introduced — all colors flow through the existing\n63-CSS-variable theme tokens. Two icon-registry entries added (keyboard,\nrefresh-cw) since they were genuinely missing.\n\nANN-7 first-impression pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Paperclip <noreply@paperclip.ing>","tree":{"sha":"c3d4b53df0bbf4fd30537ebb1a78aa8dfea12056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/c3d4b53df0bbf4fd30537ebb1a78aa8dfea12056"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/5fb0b470461ddb0be8b8e2d0c9fa493d0f49402d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/5fb0b470461ddb0be8b8e2d0c9fa493d0f49402d","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDVmYjBiNDcwNDYxZGRiMGJlOGI4ZTJkMGM5ZmE0OTNkMGY0OTQwMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/4793239c529c43e8eac564ca0805501fd08772ce","sha":"4793239c529c43e8eac564ca0805501fd08772ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/4793239c529c43e8eac564ca0805501fd08772ce"}],"sha":"5fb0b470461ddb0be8b8e2d0c9fa493d0f49402d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/5fb0b470461ddb0be8b8e2d0c9fa493d0f49402d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/4793239c529c43e8eac564ca0805501fd08772ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-12T20:17:17Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-12T20:17:17Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"Add shared skills loader + LLMProvider interface + AnthropicProvider\n\nFoundation for the embedded agent (ANN-3). The MCP server and the (future)\nembedded runner now share a single source of truth for skill content.\n\n- src/skills: cached loader for bundled SKILL.md + companion playbooks, plus\n  getSystemPrompt() that assembles the prompt with the task-type companion\n  appended (A11Y_RULES.md for a11y_fix, THEME_UPDATE.md for theme_update).\n- src/embedded/provider.ts: LLMProvider interface + ProviderEvent union\n  (text / tool_call / usage / done / error). Stream contract is minimal so\n  OpenAI / Gemini implementations can land later without touching callers.\n- src/embedded/anthropic-provider.ts: concrete provider using the official\n  Anthropic SDK with cache_control: ephemeral on the system block. SDK is a\n  peer-optional dep and loaded lazily so MCP-only consumers don''t carry it.\n- src/mcp/server.ts: initialize response now returns the annotask-apply\n  system prompt as `instructions`, sourced from the shared loader.\n- Tests: skill loader idempotency + companion selection, provider stream\n  ordering with a fake SDK client, cache-control marker placement, and the\n  MCP initialize wiring (raw HTTP round-trip).\n\n265/265 vitest pass; tsc --noEmit clean; tsup build succeeds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Paperclip <noreply@paperclip.ing>","tree":{"sha":"6361b8dc0a30f6fb7be4417bcb5f6e7c9b9ba2bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/6361b8dc0a30f6fb7be4417bcb5f6e7c9b9ba2bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/4793239c529c43e8eac564ca0805501fd08772ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"htt