ithub.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/9434b3e80dd62b68ab52fa21b4c87622ac853699/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T00:44:13Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T00:44:13Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"Refresh docs for runtime endpoints, task sidecars, worker-thread scan\n\n- README / AGENTS: correct MCP tool count (18 → 21), add the three new\n  tools (interaction_history, rendered_html, runtime_endpoints), list\n  the matching CLI commands, and rewrite the interaction-history /\n  rendered-HTML section to reflect \"always captured, embed toggle only\n  gates payload inclusion\".\n- docs/api.md: add runtime-endpoint routes (with merge_static / route /\n  orphans_only query params), task sidecar routes, and the three new\n  MCP tools.\n- docs/cli.md: document `interaction-history`, `rendered-html`, and\n  `runtime-endpoints` commands plus their flags.\n- docs/skills.md / docs/distribution.md: list the new companion\n  playbooks, the component-scanner worker bundle, and drop the\n  hardcoded version number in favour of __ANNOTASK_VERSION__.\n- docs/architecture.md: mention the component-scanner worker and the\n  runtime-endpoint dataflow in the server layer.\n- docs/REVIEWING.md: update App.vue line count to the current size.\n- SECURITY.md: cover the 200 KB rendered-HTML cap, zod-at-the-boundary\n  validation, WebSocket maxPayload, crypto.randomBytes(8) screenshot\n  names + MCP path-traversal fix, and server.json 0o600 mode.","tree":{"sha":"bda6f57c0502a9a0113a471db959f67da665be46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/bda6f57c0502a9a0113a471db959f67da665be46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/9434b3e80dd62b68ab52fa21b