g{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/a7d101a3aeea5a264aecba94f444c7041dc34f3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T00:43:53Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T00:43:53Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"Split annotask-apply skill with a11y and theme companion playbooks\n\nSKILL.md trimmed to the core apply loop; the heavy per-type guidance\nmoved into A11Y_RULES.md and THEME_UPDATE.md, which the skill reads on\ndemand when it encounters an `a11y_fix` or `theme_update` task. Keeps\nthe always-loaded SKILL.md short while still giving agents the detailed\nplaybook when they need it.","tree":{"sha":"6d11e34ca46902fd582d37fd8a1bd76202fd0c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/6d11e34ca46902fd582d37fd8a1bd76202fd0c3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/a7d101a3aeea5a264aecba94f444c7041dc34f3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/a7d101a3aeea5a264aecba94f444c7041dc34f3f","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKGE3ZDEwMWEzYWVlYTVhMjY0YWVjYmE5NGY0NDRjNzA0MWRjMzRmM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/23a50a019dd8ed40427282c346ca4c4cef3def60","sha":"23a50a019dd8ed40427282c346ca4c4cef3def60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/23a50a019dd8ed40427282c346ca4c4cef3def60"}],"sha":"a7d101a3aeea5a264aecba94f444c7041dc34f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/a7d101a3aeea5a264aecba94f444c7041dc34f3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/23a50a019dd8ed40427282c346ca4c4cef3def60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T00:43:43Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T00:43:43Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"Move component scan to worker thread; tighten transform.ts\n\n- Run the component library scan on a dedicated worker thread so large\n  bursts of synchronous filesystem/regex work don''t block Node''s event\n  loop while the API is serving task and context requests.\n- Broadcast `components:updated` over the WebSocket when the worker lands\n  a fresh catalog so the shell''s Components tab refreshes without a\n  manual reload.\n- Drop the now-unused `component-context.ts` enrichment step (and its\n  test): the worker-backed catalog replaces the inline best-effort\n  enrichment on task create.\n- transform.ts: strip inline `type` modifiers in import parsing, accept\n  camelCase identifiers (libraries like antenna-component-library export\n  lowercase component names), and unwrap `<component :is=\"x\">` to its\n  bound identifier so dynamic components get the right source-module\n  attribute.\n- Move the \"Tab order\" toggle from inside A11yPanel into AppToolbar so\n  the Audit header stays consistent with other scan/recording controls.\n- Reorder DataSourcesPage tabs to Network/Hooks/APIs and simplify the\n  API tooltip.","tree":{"sha":"a5d62b8b32e3511b0cadb68113f6a8ccd0936467","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/a5d62b8b32e3511b0cadb68113f6a8ccd0936467"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/23a50a019dd8ed40427282c346ca4c4cef3def60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/23a50a019dd8ed40427282c346ca4c4cef3def60","node_id":"C_kwDORzheQtoAKDIzYTUwYTAxOWRkOGVkNDA0MjcyODJjMzQ2Y2E0YzRjZWYzZGVmNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer/annotask/commit/b763a1fbaa952db114ebd037860b51c7a733070a","sha":"b763a1fbaa952db114ebd037860b51c7a733070a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/b763a1fbaa952db114ebd037860b51c7a733070a"}],"sha":"23a50a019dd8ed40427282c346ca4c4cef3def60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/23a50a019dd8ed40427282c346ca4c4cef3def60"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/pr