/users/kurtstohrer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/commits/2e5519bf9d9542299ee136e1f291b68037e267bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T20:44:41Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T20:44:41Z","email":"kurtstohrer@gmail.com","name":"Kurt Stohrer"},"message":"Dedup fetch entries by (method, endpoint) in data source scanner\n\nTwo fetch() calls to the same endpoint with different HTTP methods (e.g.\nGET + PATCH on /api/tenants/:id) collapsed into a single catalog entry,\nhiding mutations that shared a URL with an earlier read in the same file.\n\n- Add optional `method` field to ProjectDataEntry\n- Extract method from axios.<verb>, fetch/ofetch/$fetch options, hx-* attrs\n- Replace non-greedy inline-call regex with a balanced-paren walker so the\n  options object is visible past nested encodeURIComponent(...) etc.\n- Include method in display_name and the binding-graph key","tree":{"sha":"bfb3748f5fa183a85cf15f1552aba6aafab30996","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/trees/bfb3748f5fa183a85cf15f1552aba6aafab30996"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kurtstohrer/annotask/git/commits/2e5519bf9d9542299ee136e1f291b68037e267bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8736612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kurtstohrer","id":8736612,"login":"kurtstohrer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MzY2MTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kurtstohrer/orgs","received_even