?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bochek/bochek-mission-control/commits/dd15409a6bd4fb0d7eee84a4ac0d29f896b37158/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T17:56:39Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T17:56:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix/memory system audit (#502)\n\n* fix: memory system security, integrity, and performance improvements\n\n- Extract shared path safety helpers to src/lib/memory-path.ts (DRY)\n- Fix path traversal in /api/memory/links using resolveSafeMemoryPath()\n- Add isPathAllowed() prefix check to /api/memory/links route\n- Enforce MEMORY_ALLOWED_PREFIXES in /api/memory/context route\n- Add migration 047 for working_memory column (removes runtime ALTER TABLE)\n- Fix workspace/DB dual-write staleness: compare mtime vs updated_at\n- Add 512KB MAX_WORKING_MEMORY_SIZE guard on PUT (returns 413)\n- Eliminate double directory scan in buildLinkGraph/health/context\n- Extract getAgentByIdOrName() helper to reduce duplication\n\n* feat: FTS5 full-text search for memory + MCP knowledge tools\n\n- Add SQLite FTS5 virtual table for memory filesystem search\n- Replace brute-force substring search with BM25-ranked results\n- Support FTS5 query syntax: AND, OR, NOT, NEAR, \"phrase\", prefix*\n- Auto-build index on first search, incremental updates on save/delete\n- Add /api/memory/search route (GET search, POST rebuild index)\n- Add migration 048_memory_fts for FTS5 table creation\n- Add snippet extraction with <mark> highlighting\n- Porter stemming + unicode tokenization for better recall\n\nMCP tools added (5 new):\n- mc_search_knowledge: full-text search with FTS5\n- mc_read_knowledge_file: read file content + wiki-links\n- mc_write_knowledge_file: create/update knowledge files\n- mc_knowledge_health: run health diagnostics\n- mc_rebuild_search_index: rebuild FTS index\n\n* feat: enhanced consolidation pipeline with gap detection and graph analysis\n\nAdd two new knowledge maintenance passes inspired by LACP:\n\ngap-detect: severity-scored knowledge gap detection\n  - Broken wiki-links (severity 0.8)\n  - Orphan files with no connections (severity 0.5)\n  - Stale files scored by age (age/90 days, capped at 1.0)\n  - Knowledge gaps: terms referenced 2+ times without a file\n\nconsolidate: graph structure analysis\n  - Hub detection: files with disproportionately many connections\n  - Bridge detection: nodes whose removal would fragment the graph\n  - Cluster detection: connected components with density scoring\n  - Weak edge detection: links between unrelated neighborhoods\n\nNew API actions: POST /api/memory/process { action: \"gap-detect\" | \"consolidate\" }\nNew MCP tools: mc_knowledge_gaps, mc_knowledge_consolidate\n\n* docs(openapi): add /api/memory/search contract entries","tree":{"sha":"d35e2348eafdd6f57257e2b9bb3c95fcc8fcddd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bochek/bochek-mission-control/git/trees/d35e2348eafdd6f57257e2b9bb3c95fcc8fcddd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bochek/bochek-mission-control/git/commits/dd15409a6bd4fb0d7eee84a4ac0d29f896b37158","verifica