s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bochek/bochek-mission-control/commits/0f70fd51541fdd4188e52aca39b841e6dd221af6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T17:35:29Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T17:35:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: post-onboarding Launch Sequence for empty dashboards (#500)\n\n* feat: post-onboarding launch sequence for empty dashboards\n\nWhen no agents or tasks exist, the dashboard shows a guided\n\"Launch Sequence\" with three steps:\n1. Agent Runtimes — links to Settings for runtime installation\n2. Dock an Agent — links to the existing Create Agent wizard\n3. Dispatch a Task — links to the task board\n\nEach step activates progressively (step 2 unlocks after step 1,\netc.) with visual state: completed (green), active (amber), locked\n(dimmed). A progress bar shows overall completion.\n\nThe launchpad auto-hides once agents and tasks exist, revealing\nthe normal widget grid underneath.\n\n* fix: fall back to capabilities endpoint for runtime detection\n\n* feat: animated shimmer progress bar in Launch Sequence","tree":{"sha":"06f3ea0c558c83570af1ad6cf6243f5f58d0e40d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bochek/bochek-mission-control/git/trees/06f3ea0c558c83570af1ad6cf6243f5f58d0e40d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bochek/bochek-mission-control/git/commits/0f70fd51541fdd4188e52aca39b841e6dd221af6","verification":{"payload":"tree 06f3ea0c558c83570af1ad6cf6243f5f58d0e40d\nparent c16aa4ca8ced366f84e996cd735b83d93073348b\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774373729 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774373729 +0700\n\nfeat: post-onboarding Launch Sequence for empty dashboards (#500)\n\n* feat: post-onboarding launch sequence for empty dashboards\n\nWhen no agents or tasks exist, the dashboard shows a guided\n\"Launch Sequence\" with three steps:\n1. Agent Runtimes — links to Settings for runtime installation\n2. Dock an Agent — links to the existing Create Agent wizard\n3. Dispatch a Task — links to the task board\n\nEach step activates progressively (step 2 unlocks after step 1,\netc.) with visual state: completed (green), active (amber), locked\n(dimmed). A progress bar shows overall completion.\n\nThe launchpad auto-hides once agents and tasks exist, revealing\nthe normal widget grid underneath.\n\n* fix: fall back to capabilities endpoint for runtime detection\n\n* feat: animated shimmer progress bar in Launch Sequence","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwsthCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAabMQAAtcYQ1Y6gdcXTelqmc0/fta\naQkp/gvpzDbfqKykvTQEXdGffg/yhU7e/faGIq9U/cf/xdol0I429C21nm0eFWcq\np2MWUEIg9gPiObvqzWt5DWm8f8oSJpztT3qQ1ZsBDXCRKjmGJsywq/a8VuCXMh+M\ng1TLOm4P9J8au3Cx+mVWagnDg+xBkmUBCxk7YB2AoaAJGodG6SWNtw3XhJsS0nTC\nOiy59Gri9f1Tsx9OlDBIwrjpD+IXklE+aOQolPfqCu3aUoPwrW1g834KK+wv7x0E\nAOPlkLhjFS8xHCU2za+qXJDPvLOifSB2qxma1cOEdHc5GWq2e73ofBKfGgsOV1Rb\n2yrKuaKDLarezbYgUmFkwH6ptyxyGkSov64r/GiBQxbBL0DcRF0FFRZ8eloeeatX\nz5VznJOUX6TswrewsjaOe6gRsF+HAEKv+M08dt8yBbv2YV7ggYNXsAVFiHkhfNOE\nA2RQ+KTrQ8B223PiFwPJHdi3uhDVf1hcIis0oqRTuDGqmle9eFAQ4dkmBjBy3NMd\ny3oy6GZYqEcZ5jgan/TEqznBdHvOnwZTpErmPPVox6PNcS0FDxXnCnzWRbev6deL\n8dujmWmIrlkUxJhEAlC1LDZeTPnKimeS4Ctxr/x2h75Do3FZx1U+6itKkrH8S3KQ\nTm57NKtw0Afh2u3YTews\n=/gsF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-29T06:06:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt