"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jay-Gould7/InsightMesh/commits/d2c39a91335f7e262cbccc14ec3e283e30a8856e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T15:55:44Z","email":"gold.xxtxx@gmail.com","name":"Jay-Gould7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T15:55:44Z","email":"gold.xxtxx@gmail.com","name":"Jay-Gould7"},"message":"feat(settlement): upgrade anti-sybil engine and unify creator management UI\n\n- **Anti-Sybil Engine**: Implemented an exponential saturation model for consensus scoring to strongly penalize Sybil farm behaviors.\n- **Data Persistence**: Added the `disqualified` field to the Prisma `Analysis` schema to log and track intercepted wallet addresses.\n- **Unified Dashboard**: Removed the dedicated `/settle` route and seamlessly integrated the settlement module into the `/insights` page, centralizing all creator controls into a single \"Manage\" view.\n- **Enterprise-Grade UI**:\n  - Restructured the AI Insights layout with generous spacing (`space-y-16`) and expanded the cluster chart to full-width.\n  - Redesigned AI Highlights into a 3-column masonry grid with premium badge typography instead of a squeezed list.\n  - Built an interactive `AntiSybilPanel` exposing disqualified entries and reasoning transparently.\n  - Implemented smooth `framer-motion` expansion inside the `ScoreTable` rows to reveal original Q&A content seamlessly.\n- **UX Polish**: Eliminated hover layout jitters on the BackButton component and synchronized the `LightRays` background effects across all management routes.","tree":{"sha":"eaba729fbd7a7ec30b866d330b11a87b94ba1146","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jay-Gould7/InsightMesh/git/trees/eaba729fbd7a7ec30b866d330b11a87b94ba1146"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jay-Gould7/InsightMesh/git/commits/d2c39a91335f7e262cbccc14ec3e283e30a8856e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256372400?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jay-Gould7","id":256372400,"login":"Jay-Gould7","node_id":"U_kgDOD0fusA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jay-Gould7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jay-Gould7/InsightMesh/commit/d2c39a91335f7e262cbccc14ec3e283e30a8856e","node_id":"C_kwDORzvrFNoAKGQyYzM5YTkxMzM1ZjdlMjYyY2JjY2MxNGVjM2UyODNlMzBhODg1NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jay-Gould7/InsightMesh/commit/4d0d256b27358ef886d098caf2abcbd47e083cd5","sha":"4d0d256b27358ef886d098caf2abcbd47e083cd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jay-Gould7/InsightMesh/commits/4d0d256b27358ef886d098caf2abcbd47e083cd5"}],"sha":"d2c39a91335f7e262cbccc14ec3e283e30a8856e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jay-Gould7/InsightMesh/commits/d2c39a91335f7e262cbccc14ec3e283e30a8856e"},