 entry points, added all\n  plugin devDependencies and peerDependencies, vitest test script\n- packages/eslint-config/turbo.json: overrides build outputs to [] since\n  no compilation is needed for a plain JS config package\n- packages/eslint-config/test/rules.test.ts: Vitest tests verifying\n  no-explicit-any, exhaustive-deps, and no-console rules\n- packages/eslint-config/test/fixtures/: three files that intentionally\n  trigger each validated rule\n- packages/eslint-config/README.md: usage and override documentation\n- Removed src/index.ts and tsconfig.json (no TypeScript compilation needed)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_016Yk2TduHXMQMvZWBv4WUN7","tree":{"sha":"57bb229e72a5e31b67eab551fc9536709b7d8de4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wyldetech/vision-application-framework/git/trees/57bb229e72a5e31b67eab551fc9536709b7d8de4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wyldetech/vision-application-framework/git/commits/ce3b88fb36e75e21c57ead0ca427ad4e0295f1c7","verification":{"payload":"tree 57bb229e72a5e31b67eab551fc9536709b7d8de4\nparent 2cc0a93a8438f9f63ff5aee8e0669e5af4c4a1a6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774778028 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1774778028 +0000\n\nImplement @eaf/eslint-config package (Issue #2)\n\nReplaces the stub TypeScript skeleton with a fully working ESLint shared\nconfig using the legacy eslintrc format (CommonJS module.exports). Includes\nVitest tests that use the ESLint Node API to assert the three key rules fire\nagainst intentional fixture violations, satisfying all acceptance criteria.\n\n- packages/eslint-config/index.js: ESLint config with TypeScript, React,\n  react-hooks, jsx-a11y, and import rules as specified\n- packages/eslint-config/package.json: updated entry points, added all\n  plugin devDependencies and peerDependencies, vitest test script\n- packages/eslint-config/turbo.json: overrides build outputs to [] since\n  no compilation is needed for a plain JS config package\n- packages/eslint-config