\nusable degraded draft. Cap the hook to the limit before budgeting the body, with\ncorrect hook + ''\\n'' + body accounting (also fixes the prior miscalibrated -8).\n\nReported by Codex review (P2). Regression test added.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019hymj3bMMkWYPStn7Nra2P","tree":{"sha":"29f5ccf9b346c97fffd8e8953f101c28550bc202","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/atlantdak/fixlater/git/trees/29f5ccf9b346c97fffd8e8953f101c28550bc202"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/atlantdak/fixlater/git/commits/c0adaae1e775bb6a72eed14116313fe888c4e38d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20963777?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atlantdak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atlantdak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atlantdak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atlantdak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/atlantdak","id":20963777,"login":"atlantdak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTYzNzc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atlantdak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atlantdak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atlantdak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atlantdak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atlantdak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/atlantdak","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/atlantdak/fixlater/commit/c0adaae1e775bb6a72eed14116313fe888c4e38d","node_id":"C_kwDORzxxbNoAKGMwYWRhYWUxZTc3NWJiNmE3MmVlZDE0MTE2MzEzZmU4ODhjNGUzOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/atlantdak/fixlater/commit/8f9a6e700eedb7eec7a9cb6050798a122a698559","