itter":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:25:18.221Z","repositoryId":1195190740,"sha":"d62a4aca9e734dd371aa139b7a0bbba720b917fe"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"mildcodes","providerType":"User"},"email":"44657722+devKangMinHyeok@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Minhyeok Kang"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-31T14:35:19Z","committedDate":"2026-03-31T14:35:19Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:25:18.221Z","repositoryId":1195190740,"sha":"a3173219f690bda614bb0a65757bf7667c875003"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"mildcodes","providerType":"User"},"email":"44657722+devKangMinHyeok@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Minhyeok Kang"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-29T13:11:12Z","committedDate":"2026-03-29T13:11:12Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:25:18.221Z","repositoryId":1195190740,"sha":"caa83b95a5cd9e8c499849961f27f2b2d8f854bf"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"mildcodes","providerType":"User"},"email":"44657722+devKangMinHyeok@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Minhyeok Kang"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-29T10:58:47Z","committedDate":"2026-03-29T10:58:47Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:25:18.221Z","repositoryId":1195190740,"sha":"7296be4c8d5241ad5f261d37fa37e6bc05bf734f"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:25:18.221Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44657722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mildcodes","id":44657722,"login":"mildcodes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjU3NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/retemper/esmap/commits/d48cdb288de2eac45cba8d48f2638dc68ed587c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T03:00:52Z","email":"44657722+devKangMinHyeok@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Minhyeok Kang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T03:00:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: adopt lodestar for architecture enforcement (#26)\n\n* chore: adopt lodestar for architecture enforcement\n\nCodify package dependency tiers and internal module layers so that\narchitectural drift is caught in CI rather than review.\n\n- Root config enforces cross-package direction (shared → features →\n  runtime → core → adapters) via a custom package-layers rule plus\n  no-circular-packages.\n- Per-package configs (core, shared, server) enforce internal layer\n  boundaries and intra-package no-circular.\n- Adds pnpm lodestar / lodestar:graph scripts, a turbo task, and a\n  CI step in the lint job.\n\nThe custom package-layers rule is needed because the built-in\narchitecture/layers only resolves relative imports — it silently\nignores package-name imports like \"@esmap/runtime\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: add .prettierignore for generated files and tooling\n\nPrettier was checking pnpm-lock.yaml (auto-generated by pnpm) and\n.claude/ (Claude Code user tooling), producing false-positive\nfailures on any PR that touched code.\n\nPR #25 merged with format issues because it only changed .md files\nand hit the CI \"changed files\" skip. Excluding these paths is the\nroot-cause fix rather than format-patching generated content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01ff1e5664e6743785e1e7aa6a663b923fdedf9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/retemper/esmap/git/trees/01ff1e5664e6743785e1e7aa6a663b923fdedf9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/retemper/esmap/git/commits/d48cdb288de2eac45cba8d48f2638dc68ed587c4","verification":{"payload":"tree 01ff1e5664e6743785e1e7aa6a663b923fdedf9f\nparent c48e20dc52d57375478b0d6fed39caea1bb3a4aa\nauthor Minhyeok Kang <44657722+devKangMinHyeok@users.noreply.github.com> 1776481252 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776481252 +0900\n\nchore: adopt lodestar for architecture enforcement (#26)\n\n* chore: adopt lodestar for architecture enforcement\n\nCodify package dependency tiers and internal module layers so that\narchitectural drift is caught in CI rather than review.\n\n- Root config enforces cross-package direction (shared → features →\n  runtime → core → adapters) via a custom package-layers rule plus\n  no-circular-packages.\n- Per-package configs (core, shared, server) enforce internal layer\n  boundaries and intra-package no-circular.\n- Adds pnpm lodestar / lodestar:graph scripts, a turbo task, and a\n  CI step in the lint job.\n\nThe custom package-layers rule is needed because the built-in\narchitecture/layers only resolves relative imports — it silently\nignores package-name imports like \"@esmap/runtime\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: add .prettierignore for generated files and tooling\n\nPrettier was checking pnpm-lock.yaml (auto-generated by pnpm) and\n.claude/ (Claude Code user tooling), producing false-positive\nfailures on any PR that touched code.\n\nPR #25 merged with format issues because it only changed .md files\nand hit the CI \"changed files\" skip. Excluding these paths is the\nroot-cause fix rather than format-patching generated content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4vPkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHy0QAKuotq/NA00HS+C/U7W+AhJV\nYoz3YfciR3wC28S74vujNQjrl05ogDf7ldq985Ibanhh3vqw9KHCjMzWo+6ufkQc\nsZ8nj8Y2kvfCFj3bhq7HsyVOTWzg4E3uQDBw+l2ud5Bp1n5vd0MknseUAE+Tw91P\nwsAztoSBVhYQK4gI03FjUdDAVxWvE5WpzIVEWJha+yyfJGn0Cv+zmeKQ82Ur8bdT\nnYSO+wewaBPr93f9KgWBdDdqsDZWCVu1GTaFPQlAF8JcqQoJD/EuYCb4TWCqQx9X\nvm8qffANFlNlru8pcBc2+dwwdr4gg4CF+qxTwmai5r2oz1C/zwjl1hg355kVwGcn\nc6E8C3O3SamKoLYhFTfrh8d4d+vZ8ZQYQ8DCorH5geyYgmyOwNlIJEgaXKb9Qwft\n1/oGmMkiBkYnBV+bXvkGDgH9DpESt63IMGsMNJHQyG0p+zo965g4m8x46XPh88yS\njIzA47rgL7+DKCZeQ6W9h6CIfAXOHvq7VQcpqQgQcscnn38Ec1yIx0FYdrIBUQw+\nRQ74almR/J/OZ04O3MOCmovNekAKwvR3oUMQZZAmXEpXLRHnIy36Z8NVZKpGWSI6\nBgGC64c24sXGY+iyt1FC/GdTIUJ4JNsWXmPQQJ04uHtDKqaUrwTs2Yge6P+8y4M1\nrxmxKwLrgnHBjCi93bii\n=FW65\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-18T03:00:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.