y and automated release pipelines\n\nSet up changesets-based release infrastructure with:\n- RELEASE.md documenting versioning strategy, changeset workflow, and snapshot releases\n- release.yml workflow for automated version PRs and npm publishing\n- snapshot.yml workflow for PR-based canary releases via /snapshot comment\n- publishConfig with public access and provenance on all 15 packages\n- Changeset scripts in root package.json\n- Updated CONTRIBUTING.md and PR template with changeset instructions\n\nThird-party actions pinned to SHA for supply-chain safety.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: pin all GitHub Actions to commit SHAs for supply-chain safety\n\nAlso align snapshot workflow to use changeset:* npm scripts\nconsistently with the release workflow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: adapt to main changes\n\nAdd publishConfig to new @esmap/vue and @esmap/angular packages\nintroduced in main to align with release infrastructure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: format pnpm-lock.yaml\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab5dd4bcc109a16ad297bfffe211e86f9d7bd334","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/retemper/esmap/git/trees/ab5dd4bcc109a16ad297bfffe211e86f9d7bd334"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/retemper/esmap/git/commits/0a3bf4108cbb907265eaba9f4e3fdadf51c941bd","verification":{"payload":"tree ab5dd4bcc109a16ad297bfffe211e86f9d7bd334\nparent e1669a10c0d19773cc3f5fceb7534effabf64755\nauthor Minhyeok Kang <44657722+devKangMinHyeok@users.noreply.github.com> 1775002272 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775002272 +0000\n\nci: add release policy and automated release pipelines (#10)\n\n* ci: add release policy and automated release pipelines\n\nSet up changesets-based release infrastructure with:\n- RELEASE.md documenting versioning strategy, changeset workflow, and snapshot releases\n- release.yml workflow for automated version PRs and npm publishing\n- snapshot.yml workflow for PR-based canary releases via /snapshot comment\n- publishConfig with public access and provenance on all 15 packages\n- Changeset scripts in root package.json\n- Updated CONTRIBUTING.md and PR template with changeset instructions\n\nThird-party actions pinned to SHA for supply-chain safety.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci: pin all GitHub Actions to commit SHAs for supply-chain safety\n\nAlso align snapshot workflow to use changeset:* npm scripts\nconsistently with the release workflow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: adapt to main changes\n\nAdd publishConfig to new @esmap/vue and @esmap/angular packages\nintroduced in main to align with release infrastructure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: format pnpm-lock.yaml\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpzGKgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4CMQAHJiIyXCZjydPCpLLATx+l+h\nSuHfCwCxClQdiuG/5Hm9O7IX+NEdrQ0ea2ElUNj8WCjLZAc3XQBLVnc0TetZ+Ed0\nG0blipCzRwcUwRQAiABh1U6rDg4o355o5dJZL890VbZOK+abvIMlfi4DWpG584/w\n7tHImPMNgTCKXmern3z0+OCf88+5Fob2i0SY6JIAPiYjp6wLBzwVfal4wJOiBMHk\nQM8ZdOrlhT/xxgY4TG27dfx/BM12j5B6u0wbfAP49zGPnLFgHo1sK/kxqQSdMpPy\n/u0q/vIPon3CFmdmbaQjH+Qn5maukZwtS344+V2Ad8q9rZhQP56vLVdYEsKihafx\njxEKg2y2QUHm+q+EDN42i9Cizm2y/SaPTGcfVnqgz2q6FxfBvrMy5S985ZCrdTEN\nHKTdLXjRugFB+oOhLANicsvODizAcumJKbVbK6IsLtXtOvVJ/a0MlEMwfPhzv0OK\niQ3xsUeI2SNnJtatVKOM68aX4BbNHjamtXclwBCBzSVJxVJWudu+PDB5JXFIwzAm\nulg1ORWfEIwQK/BCKPqpR61kz6ot6jc+FjFQfRdnX0iC8XjwK+SQ/8i/s6PKpQHG\nkgtrs+REIKpg9mvh/034FXGfXkbAphthqntbgeAR49waP/8z0VfuFr376GT6IbWl\nxbBiX4123bGfzaMy5Bc/\n=ZdbE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"202