{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mildcodes","id":44657722,"login":"mildcodes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjU3NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mildcodes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/retemper/esmap/commits/7fb92e8af4749c2f5f0e6d7339a93e15becf649f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T23:25:34Z","email":"44657722+devKangMinHyeok@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Minhyeok Kang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T23:25:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add comprehensive E2E test suite with Playwright (#9)\n\nAdd 87 E2E tests across 17 spec files covering all major framework\nfeatures: boot lifecycle, routing, keepAlive, sandbox isolation,\nCSS guard, DOM isolation, devtools, communication, error boundaries,\nperformance, and SPA navigation.\n\nSupporting changes:\n- Configure Playwright with multi-mfe example as test target\n- Give each app its own container (replace shared #app-main)\n- Clear status-log placeholder on first log entry\n- Wire lifecycle hooks into registry status transitions\n- Ensure container visibility on mount after keepAlive thaw\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e37b28f0159d26f8a3f0be6c0c037657e7bc29ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/retemper/esmap/git/trees/e37b28f0159d26f8a3f0be6c0c037657e7bc29ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/retemper/esmap/git/commits/7fb92e8af4749c2f5f0e6d7339a93e15becf649f","verification":{"payload":"tree e37b28f0159d26f8a3f0be6c0c037657e7bc29ad\nparent ebfb3c50424c58f07ec415e960e44619c5179701\nauthor Minhyeok Kang <44657722+devKangMinHyeok@users.noreply.github.com> 1774999534 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774999534 +0000\n\ntest: add comprehensive E2E test suite with Playwright (#9)\n\nAdd 87 E2E tests across 17 spec files covering all major framework\nfeatures: boot lifecycle, routing, keepAlive, sandbox isolation,\nCSS guard, DOM isolation, devtools, communication, error boundaries,\nperformance, and SPA navigation.\n\nSupporting changes:\n- Configure Playwright with multi-mfe example as test target\n- Give each app its own container (replace shared #app-main)\n- Clear status-log placeholder on first log entry\n- Wire lifecycle hooks into registry status transitions\n- Ensure container visibility on mount after keepAlive thaw\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpzFfuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbysQACVjXDyl+BwH5Mr0JwQ9r4lc\nxk7nx9PIxyszhUnY0ns5yHfxvntAfTDkazbUZWtmnqru1gnrbSXQYzobbw/Vxrhu\n0Tm4baa1LxxFUlZjb5KzWbKBvgC14H1olrN5NniVMvhTkj6zwkScqdv1kOSrDPp6\nrExviWkgTFa0LmlHoduZ9Nf9YALisF0AKl5cFbN1g1BaaB0fAxZ+2OqL0gqz7yBY\n9PugjKkBNkJMtuouHPalgj00F415DQux7RfKb1RNRlQmy5HF0/5QUfyrebGE4irK\nwBaC/FAA5LTdPSdxJO55BXzwUm/1EzftvV7bMR3pIqhABxG84LSvSYQ67Xz258sD\nb787UCVtLsf5wca6ef6M9+asrSmcCY+eGZsMNj6ZvAzAMfXyOhInLdPi8Rj2X+w4\nbt2Qc+48lkPwGuGgQoE7iXerShK9GoPP5Xz4WNmUKEsptbv+55Jm+Qly9PoKfhxG\nK6yLIRc/KLD9RW4nfXPcZmKadXG2Z1AnHxd/FdXVsS5bkxfDBgwWwvJ5yu+TW/ux\nWWH9KtOKSWvar9jxNCoXc92aiqfJjqApdAw2WMk+p17ctw8mJoCVEynGaH/lNzYB\nYeg0RetCCbwCNTM8v8vEXhpj7mne8tiHEUZ2B5T8WArhUFzIIrHwUJEDAeZi2rYG\nfSlJFUMOKGejNpfzZaMY\n=oyIH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-31T23:25:34Z"}},"committer":{"ava