},"html_url":"https://github.com/classical91/mission-control/commit/034865201e28cc097e00a95ed73a4248c5c259be","node_id":"C_kwDORz7BONoAKDAzNDg2NTIwMWUyOGNjMDk3ZTAwYTk1ZWQ3M2E0MjQ4YzVjMjU5YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/classical91/mission-control/commit/1acbf8e0537ca93c277ea603dc942e79f6d92c5b","sha":"1acbf8e0537ca93c277ea603dc942e79f6d92c5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/commits/1acbf8e0537ca93c277ea603dc942e79f6d92c5b"}],"sha":"034865201e28cc097e00a95ed73a4248c5c259be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/commits/034865201e28cc097e00a95ed73a4248c5c259be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/commits/1acbf8e0537ca93c277ea603dc942e79f6d92c5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T12:06:07Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T12:06:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: auto-route inbox tasks to best available agent (#476)\n\nTasks in inbox status are now automatically assigned to the best\nmatching agent based on role affinity and capability scoring:\n\n- Role keywords: coder matches code/implement/fix, researcher matches\n  research/analyze/audit, etc.\n- Agent capabilities from config are matched against task text\n- Idle agents preferred over busy ones\n- Capacity limit: agents with 3+ in-progress tasks are skipped\n- Runs every 60s before task dispatch (inbox → assigned → dispatch)\n\nFlow: create task (inbox) → auto-route picks best agent (assigned)\n→ scheduler dispatches to Claude API (in_progress) → response stored\n(review) → Aegis approves (done). Fully hands-free.","tree":{"sha":"91f9cd859ae22af92811c30c3af400faa9393fa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/git/trees/91f9cd859ae22af92811c30c3af400faa9393fa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/git/commits/1acbf8e0537ca93c277ea603dc942e79f6d92c5b","verification":{"payload":"tree 91f9cd859ae22af92811c30c3af400faa9393fa0\nparent 27f6a3d6c14849196a0b7f47794f4a4d484a0176\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774181167 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774181167 +0700\n\nfeat: auto-route inbox tasks to best available agent (#476)\n\nTasks in inbox status are now automatically assigned to the best\nmatching agent based on role affinity and capability scoring:\n\n- Role keywords: coder matches code/implement/fix, researcher matches\n  research/analyze/audit, etc.\n- Agent capabilities from config are matched against task text\n- Idle agents preferred over busy ones\n- Capacity limit: agents with 3+ in-progress tasks are skipped\n- Runs every 60s before task dispatch (inbox → assigned → dispatch)\n\nFlow: create task (inbox) → auto-route picks best agent (assigned)\n→ scheduler dispatches to Claude API (in_progress) → response stored\n(review) → Aegis approves (done). Fully hands-free.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv9svCRC1aQ7uu5UhlA