","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/commits/f2747b53300777805d31e064a3a423c630fed73b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T12:30:28Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T12:30:28Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"message":"feat(cli): v2 rewrite with full command coverage and lazy evaluation\n\n- Fix eager required() evaluation bug (route map was evaluated at parse\n  time, causing unrelated commands to crash on missing flags)\n- Refactor to lazy command handler pattern (functions only execute when\n  their group+action matches)\n- Add compound subcommands: agents memory get|set|clear, agents soul\n  get|set|templates, tasks comments list|add\n- Add missing PRD commands: agents attribution, tasks broadcast,\n  sessions transcript, tokens agent-costs/task-costs/trends/export/rotate,\n  status health/overview/dashboard/gateway/models/capabilities,\n  export audit/tasks/activities/pipelines\n- Add proper SSE streaming for events watch (NDJSON in --json mode,\n  human-readable otherwise, graceful Ctrl+C shutdown)\n- Add optional() helper for flags with defaults\n- Update docs/cli-agent-control.md with full v2 command reference","tree":{"sha":"fac086491e3b02941f42f9ca8891eb3a4630632f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/git/trees/fac086491e3b02941f42f9ca8891eb3a4630632f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/git/commits/f2747b53300777805d31e064a3a423c630fed73b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com