api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/commits/24493638682463a65ec29ebb550a00bd14098816/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-14T14:44:11Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-14T14:44:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: stop forcing dangerouslyDisableDeviceAuth + fix exec security value\n\n- Remove unconditional `dangerouslyDisableDeviceAuth = true` from MC\n  origin registration. MC should only add its origin to allowedOrigins,\n  not silently downgrade the gateway''s device auth security posture.\n\n- Replace invalid `sandbox` value with `allowlist` in security scan\n  and auto-fix for `tools.exec.security`. Current OpenClaw validates\n  only: deny, allowlist, full. The old `sandbox` value was rejected.\n\nCloses #357, closes #356","tree":{"sha":"dcb6138fb23fbca9ec0b63900033706ef3ed0ce3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/git/trees/dcb6138fb23fbca9ec0b63900033706ef3ed0ce3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/classical91/mission-control/git/commits/24493638682463a65ec29ebb550a00bd14098816","verification":{"payload":"tree dcb6138fb23fbca9ec0b63900033706ef3ed0ce3\nparent 3525c4543fcaab3ddb7c4b1bc383cb8e1e205c5a\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1773499451 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773499451 +0700\n\nfix: stop forcing dangerouslyDisableDeviceAuth + fix exec security value\n\n- Remove unconditional `dangerouslyDisableDeviceAuth = true` from MC\n  origin registration. MC should only add its origin to allowedOrigins,\n  not silently downgrade the gateway''s device auth security posture.\n\n- Replace invalid `sandbox` value with `allowlist` in security scan\n  and auto-fix for `tools.exec.security`. Current OpenClaw validates\n  only: deny, allowlist, full. The old `sandbox` value was rejected.\n\nClose