 builder with per-outcome completion rates\n- ManagerController: GET /api/v1/manager/team-rollup and rcdo-coverage\n- TeamRollupResponse + RcdoCoverageResponse nested record DTOs\n- SecurityConfig: stateless sessions, CORS, manager endpoints auth-gated\n- JwtAuthenticationFilter: extracts userId + role from Bearer JWT\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c72a378c9f3c2c72673c27736e14637cc0c3b05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/5c72a378c9f3c2c72673c27736e14637cc0c3b05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/8f87a2219f4f6fc3f0a57b31175f312e4c26eb7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91920446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helloblair","id":91920446,"login":"helloblair","node_id":"U_kgDOBXqYPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/commit/8f87a2219f4f6fc3f0a57b31175f312e4c26eb7c","node_id":"C_kwDOR0AdNtoAKDhmODdhMjIxOWY0ZjZmYzNmMGE1N2IzMTE3NWYzMTJlNGMyNmViN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/he