ciliationRequest shape\n- ReconciledSummary: planned-vs-actual side-by-side grid, aggregate\n  stats cards (completed/partial/not started/blocked), completion\n  percentage, blocker callout sections\n- Both wired into WeeklyCommitPage for RECONCILING and RECONCILED states\n- Fix reconciliation submit to send {commits: [...]} wrapper matching\n  the backend DTO, and remove redundant transitionPlan double-call\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a45d49da09961b9dd2f6dd1d350ce809993ee71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/0a45d49da09961b9dd2f6dd1d350ce809993ee71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/f0d26008dccf0950373687f15be94bb41025dc21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91920446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helloblair","id":91920446,"login":"helloblair","node_id":"U_kgDOBXqYPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/commit/f0d26008dccf0950373687f15be94bb41025dc21","node_id":"C_kwDOR0AdNtoAKGYwZDI2MD