eplace flat status text banner with a 4-step visual LifecycleStepper\n  (numbered dots, connectors, checkmarks for past states)\n- Add \"Lock Week\" and \"Start Reconciliation\" transition buttons that call\n  the existing backend endpoints\n- Wire ChessBoard into the DRAFT view so users can drag-to-categorize\n- Render CommitCards for all commits below ChessBoard (edit/delete access)\n- Add \"Carried forward\" badge to CommitCard when carriedFromId is set\n- Include previously untracked ChessBoard, CommitCard, CommitForm components\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"741feb356732d056a554a44300f1690cda32ac9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/741feb356732d056a554a44300f1690cda32ac9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/21db69e07057f1c5fbfc936c4f2b73996e65c0ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91920446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helloblair","id":91920446,"login":"helloblair","node_id":"U_kgDOBXqYPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://