idate duplicate IllegalTransitionException\n\nDelete orphaned CommitRequest.java and CommitResponse.java (superseded by\nCommitCreateRequest/CommitUpdateRequest and WeeklyCommitResponse). Merge\nthe statemachine-local IllegalTransitionException into the exception\npackage version, fixing a bug where state machine errors would return 500\ninstead of 409 CONFLICT because GlobalExceptionHandler only caught the\nexception package class.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d99abc5aae0bf46e0a10f3adff858447cbdfbf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/4d99abc5aae0bf46e0a10f3adff858447cbdfbf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/de4f61504ccbb53c7d0851d17e08ab70f692649f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91920446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helloblair","id":91920446,"login":"helloblair","node_id":"U_kgDOBXqYPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/commit/de4f61504ccbb53c7d0851d17e08ab70f692649f","node_id":