mmitUpdateRequest\nwith plan-scoped method signatures. Fixes WeeklyCommitController endpoints\nto nest GET/POST under /api/v1/plans/{planId}/commits and keep PUT/DELETE\nat /api/v1/commits/{commitId}. Adds @Valid on request bodies. Updates\nWeeklyPlanService to use PlanStatus, SnapshotType, and WeeklyCommitResponse.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5fdf47e776d254fae3df84db242c3de6fc72f9ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/5fdf47e776d254fae3df84db242c3de6fc72f9ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/b304d8933275053dfc9eca4d85d733d48cc618d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91920446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/helloblair","id":91920446,"login":"helloblair","node_id":"U_kgDOBXqYPg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/helloblair","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/helloblair/weekly-commit-module/commit/b304d8933275053dfc9eca4d85d733d48cc618d4","node_id":"C_kwDOR0AdNtoAKGIzMDRkODkzMzI3NTA1M2RmYzllY2E0ZDg1ZDczM2Q0OGNjNjE4ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hell