nthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T06:10:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Hint that the +N overlay opens a photo grid\n\nThe third side photo on a checkpoint card now reads \"+N (click to view\nmore)\" so it''s clear the overlay is interactive. The full-grid modal\nalso gets a small \"Click/tap a photo to see a larger version\" line at\nthe top so the same affordance is obvious there.","tree":{"sha":"3792c0d4bd2cb52cc848ab3aaa9d7b43abfad90f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/git/trees/3792c0d4bd2cb52cc848ab3aaa9d7b43abfad90f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/git/commits/5ebc898bad7db7517e17e6a2dae34337e114674c","verification":{"payload":"tree 3792c0d4bd2cb52cc848ab3aaa9d7b43abfad90f\nparent 5028b6436e0e0d139008e148787970611a5e43f9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778047844 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778047844 +0000\n\nHint that the +N overlay opens a photo grid\n\nThe third side photo on a checkpoint card now reads \"+N (click to view\nmore)\" so it''s clear the overlay is interactive. The full-grid modal\nalso gets a small \"Click/tap a photo to see a larger version\" line at\nthe top so the same affordance is obvious there.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC1DanPD\nBEUtDxhjHrfVSGSBl0wciznappU9vo4kdVePHpXEc8J34F53eo7FtzL3w0cysfTgbEOTHUTZEKTM\nIQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-06T06:10:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samrford/beyond/commit/5ebc898bad7db7517e17e6a2dae34337e114674c","node_id":"C_kwDOR0CSm9oAKDVlYmM4OThiYWQ3ZGI3NTE3ZTE3ZTZhMmRhZTM0MzM3ZTExNDY3NGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samrford/beyond/commit/5028b6436e0e0d139008e148787970611a5e43f9","sha":"5028b6436e0e0d139008e148787970611a5e43f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/commits/5028b6436e0e0d139008e148787970611a5e43f9"}],"sha":"5ebc898bad7db7517e17e6a2dae34337e114674c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/commits/5ebc898bad7db7517e17e6a2dae34337e114674c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/commits/5028b6436e0e0d139008e148787970611a5e43f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T05:53:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T05:53:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Improve public trip nav and default to dark mode\n\nWhen viewing a public trip you don''t own, the back button now returns\nto the owner''s profile (`/u/<handle>`) and reads \"Back to <handle>''s\nprofile\". The trip GET endpoint joins user_profiles to expose\nownerHandle so the client can build that link.\n\nDark mode is now the default for everyone. The \"system\" theme option\nhas been removed; the only persisted preference is an explicit \"light\"\noverride. The blocking head script and ThemeClient were simplified to\nmatch.","tree":{"sha":"d27232ae0fa888e10ee610b6be21d0cb135a52a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/git/trees/d27232ae0fa888e10ee610b6be21d0cb135a52a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/git/commits/5028b6436e0e0d139008e148787970611a5e43f9","verification":{"payload":"tree d27232ae0fa888e10ee610b6be21d0cb135a52a2\nparent d23e2f5b3a2d5ae65ad62ce2e1a7abea8ab0ec98\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778046836 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1778046836 +0000\n\nImprove public trip nav and default to dark mode\n\nWhen viewing a public trip you don''t own, the back button now returns\nto the owner''s profile (`/u/<handle>`) and reads \"Back to <handle>''s\nprofile\". The trip GET endpoint joins user_profiles to expose\nownerHandle so the client can build that link.\n\nDark mode is now the default for everyone. The \"system\" theme option\nhas been removed; the only persisted preference is an explicit \"light\"\noverride. The blocking head script and ThemeClient were simplified to\nmatch.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMnlMDEt\n3mgw+lD6EerQxYhgyQQwDwvJjMxWfpgwsVRUDBE5Lui5oFa9Y/ghAER8EknPOlg+V6MKk3yTHmd5\nQAw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-06T05:54:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samrford/beyond/commit/5028b6436e0e0d139008e148787970611a5e43f9","node_id":"C_kwDOR0CSm9oAKDUwMjhiNjQzNmUwZTBkMTM5MDA4ZTE0ODc4Nzk3MDYxMWE1ZTQzZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samrford/beyond/commit/d23e2f5b3a2d5ae65ad62ce2e1a7abea8ab0ec98","sha":"d23e2f5b3a2d5ae65ad62ce2e1a7abea8ab0ec98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/commits/d23e2f5b3a2d5ae65ad62ce2e1a7abea8ab0ec98"}],"sha":"5028b6436e0e0d139008e148787970611a5e43f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/commits/5028b6436e0e0d139008e148787970611a5e43f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://a