T20:46:50Z","email":"45601025+infinitea1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Infinitea1"},"message":"fix(date-picker): make full chevron button area respond to hover\n\nThe month_caption div had position: relative, which made it stack on top\nof the absolutely-positioned nav (since it comes later in DOM order with\nboth being positioned). The caption div then intercepted pointer events\non roughly two-thirds of each chevron button, so only the outer sliver\nof the prev/next buttons reacted to hover.\n\nThe nav doesn''t actually anchor to month_caption, so the relative\npositioning wasn''t needed. Removing it lets the absolute nav stack\nabove as intended and restores the full button hit-area.","tree":{"sha":"d6b8420a5b7c1234c59e1c1063cb00797ce46e04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/git/trees/d6b8420a5b7c1234c59e1c1063cb00797ce46e04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samrford/beyond/git/commits/b133506f27fb7b658b7e62bae9e3f2330e89fa95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45601025?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infinitea1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infinitea1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infinitea1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infinitea1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/infinitea1","id":45601025,"login":"infinitea1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NjAxMDI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infinitea1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infinitea1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infinitea1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infinitea1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/infinitea1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/