TE0YTZhMzJkZDMzZDhhYmZhMDdiN2RiNzlkMjAxM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Fodin/courses/commit/3379483dcb9d2fad0330cfecf1f422a0de3f94d5","sha":"3379483dcb9d2fad0330cfecf1f422a0de3f94d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fodin/courses/commits/3379483dcb9d2fad0330cfecf1f422a0de3f94d5"}],"sha":"bde35b88914a6a32dd33d8abfa07b7db79d2013e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fodin/courses/commits/bde35b88914a6a32dd33d8abfa07b7db79d2013e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15780894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fodin","id":15780894,"login":"Fodin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzgwODk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fodin/courses/commits/3379483dcb9d2fad0330cfecf1f422a0de3f94d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T19:16:56Z","email":"fadmin@list.ru","name":"Fedor Odintsov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T19:16:56Z","email":"fadmin@list.ru","name":"Fedor Odintsov"},"message":"feat(api-design): уровни Security и HATEOAS + field filtering/gzip\n\nРасширение курса по мотивам книги «RESTful API Design Principles» (BPB).\nЗакрыты два пробела курса относительно книги:\n\n- Уровень 12 «Безопасность API» (новый): аутентификация (Basic/Bearer/JWT),\n  авторизация (RBAC/ABAC/OAuth2 scopes, 401 vs 403), шифрование TLS,\n  логирование. Задания: JWT-декодер, матрица доступа, self-check по защите.\n- Уровень 13 «HATEOAS и состояние ресурса» (новый): гипермедиа _links,\n  Richardson L3, условные ссылки (state→links), форматы HAL/JSON:API/Siren.\n  Задания: навигатор по гипермедиа, конструктор _links, self-check по дизайну.\n- Уровень 5 дополнен field filtering (sparse fieldsets) и сжатием gzip (гл.7).\n\nИтоговый проект перенумерован 12→14 (capstone остаётся последним).\nКурс: 15 уровней (0-14), 45 заданий. Теория RU+EN, README-long, по 10 квизов\nна новый уровень, Solution + стабы + Cheat. tsc -b и vite build проходят.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc85f5b4a137e1a1d5f97c750b42fc06c1f4515c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fodin/courses/git/trees/dc85f5b4a137e1a1d5f97c750b42fc06c1f4515c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Fodin/courses/git/commits/3379483dcb9d2fad0330cfecf1f422a0de3f94d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15780894?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fodin","id":15780894,"login":"Fodin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NzgwODk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fodin","user_view_type":"public"},