/commits/fd7ff9158cab217dcaf6d7f6128b1d09653b3731"}],"sha":"0801c9d2a2c1a3558ab822991b06a32bd683a039","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigknoxy/unified-jk/commits/0801c9d2a2c1a3558ab822991b06a32bd683a039"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigknoxy/unified-jk/commits/fd7ff9158cab217dcaf6d7f6128b1d09653b3731/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T15:47:44Z","email":"josh@example.com","name":"Josh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T15:47:44Z","email":"josh@example.com","name":"Josh"},"message":"fix: complete SHELL_INIT handshake for sandboxed iframes\n\nSDK Changes:\n- Add _requestShellInit() to proactively request init from shell\n- Accept origin ''null'' for sandboxed iframe messages in _isValidOrigin\n\nShell Changes:\n- Accept origin ''null'' in isValidOrigin for sandboxed iframes\n- Use ''*'' targetOrigin when responding to sandboxed iframes\n- Send SHELL_INIT response even when user is null\n\nShell Container:\n- Register origin before mounting iframe to prevent race condition\n\nFixes the SDK initialization timeout and enables end-to-end audit flow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5129f76f6066b2faecc93327585a9071d54c18bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigknoxy/unified-jk/git/trees/5129f76f6066b2faecc93327585a9071d54c18bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigknoxy/unified-jk/git/commits/fd7ff9158cab217dcaf6d7f6128b1d09653b3731","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/bigknoxy/unified-jk/commit/fd7ff9158cab217dcaf6d7f6128b1d09653b3731","node_id":"C_kwDOR0a_atoAKGZkN2ZmOTE1OGNhYjIxN2RjYWY2ZDdmNjEyOGIxZDA5NjUzYjM3MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bigknoxy/unified-jk/commit/ea1b71fca6a7e8137c0e0931ed41706a4d7cee2e","sha":"ea1b71fca6a7e8137c0e0931ed41706a4d7cee2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bigknoxy/unified-jk/commits/ea1b71f