kim-d0hyun"},"message":"정확한 동의율 계산 적용: 치료 권유받은 환자 기준\n\n동의율 정의: 치료를 권유받은 환자 중 실제 동의한 수 / 치료를 권유받은 전체 수 × 100\n\n- recommended 필드 추가 (분모 기준 — 단순 내원/검진은 제외)\n- customers: InsightPanel/필터/ConsentPill 모두 recommended 기준으로 재계산\n- dashboard: KPI 카드 동의율 + 세그먼트 탭 동의율 모두 권유 환자 분모 적용\n- reports: 동의율 레이블·차트 설명에 \"치료 권유 환자 기준\" 명시, 동의 분석 탭 정의 배너 추가\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be21807ca84b534fe9574733f88eed9f781a77da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kim-d0hyun/minish-crm/git/trees/be21807ca84b534fe9574733f88eed9f781a77da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kim-d0hyun/minish-crm/git/commits/bd8004be5c2f8a978d19a8dcb06a7382b7495e68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208414986?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-d0hyun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-d0hyun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-d0hyun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-d0hyun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kim-d0hyun","id":208414986,"login":"kim-d0hyun","node_id":"U_kgDODGwpCg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-d0hyun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-d0hyun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-d0hyun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-d0hyun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-d0hyun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kim-d0hyun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kim-d0hyun/minish-crm/commit/bd8004be5c2f8a978d19a8dcb06a7382b7495e68","node_id":"C_kwDOR0cC8toAKGJkODAwNGJlNWMyZjhhOTc4ZDE5YThkY2IwNmE3MzgyYjc0OTVlNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kim-d0hyun/minish-crm/c