4444153@qq.com","name":"Lrr"},"message":"feat: 增强 Monaco Editor NLS 适配器并完善类型定义\n\n- 新增 TypeScript 类型定义文件（loader.d.ts、transform.d.ts、vite-plugin.d.ts、proxy.d.ts）\n- 改进 package.json 的 exports 字段以支持子模块导出\n- 优化 loader.js 以支持 Webpack 5 的 this.getOptions 和 SourceMap 回调\n- 重构 transform.js，使用 magic-string 生成精确的 SourceMap\n- 增强 proxy.js 的 _format 函数以正确处理多位数参数索引\n- 扩展 index.js API，新增 getCurrentLocale、setMessages 等方法\n- 改进 vite-plugin.js，支持配置选项和更精确的路径匹配\n- 添加框架集成指南文档和简单测试用例\n- 更新中英文 README，详细说明新特性和使用方法","tree":{"sha":"3864c1ebc13f6ad16bd7f11b3556054dc23f2c1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leepule/monaco-editor-nls-adapter/git/trees/3864c1ebc13f6ad16bd7f11b3556054dc23f2c1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/leepule/monaco-editor-nls-adapter/git/commits/9c34497ba6423f7c021a55d47524824bfcb79284","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16642691?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leepule/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leepule/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leepule/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leepule/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/leepule","id":16642691,"login":"leepule","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjQyNjkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leepule/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leepule/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leepule/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leepule/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/leepule/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/leepule","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/leepule/monaco-editor-nls-adapter/commit/9c34497ba6423f7c021a55d47524824bfcb79284","node_id":"C_kwDOR0mL1NoAKDljMzQ0OTdiYTY0MjN