ite_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/commits/50cc2bd2d768d5143c75b770d38b1ca528090be2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T18:12:23Z","email":"luismenesesep@gmail.com","name":"Luis Meneses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T18:12:23Z","email":"luismenesesep@gmail.com","name":"Luis Meneses"},"message":"feat(P1-001): CSS Style Isolation via Shadow DOM\n\nAutomatic per-MFE CSS scoping using Shadow DOM to prevent style\nconflicts between independently developed micro-frontends.\n\n- ShadowContainer: renders MFE content inside an isolated shadow root\n  via createPortal, injecting captured CSS and stylesheet links\n- styleCapture: intercepts <style>/<link> tags injected into\n  document.head during Module Federation loadRemote() and redirects\n  them into the shadow boundary\n- MFESlot: wraps loaded MFE components in ShadowContainer by default;\n  reads cssIsolation mode from registry metadata\n- Types: adds CssIsolationMode (\"shadow\" | \"none\") to MFEConfig\n- Vite plugin: forwards cssIsolation config to registry via metadata\n- Opt-out: set \"cssIsolation\": \"none\" in mfe.config.json\n- CSS custom properties (design tokens) still inherit into shadow DOM\n- Unit tests: styleCapture, ShadowContainer, css-isolation (32 pass)\n- E2E tests: 6 scenarios covering shadow host presence, mount points,\n  content rendering, style leak prevention, token inheritance, and\n  layout structure preservation\n- Backlog updated with implementation notes and completion checklist\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"bb1f5a26714c8fc8ac7848cd2fc1e0eec5003dd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/git/trees/bb1f5a26714c8fc8ac7848cd2fc1e0eec5003dd1"},"url":"https://api.gith