rl":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/commits/80ef99d89d90e840bdd9b1e01a61694a0107acbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T00:42:03Z","email":"luismenesesep@gmail.com","name":"Luis Meneses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T00:42:03Z","email":"luismenesesep@gmail.com","name":"Luis Meneses"},"message":"perf: eliminate React/ReactDOM from MFE bundles — import:false\n\nMFEs no longer bundle their own fallback copy of React and ReactDOM.\nThe shared config now uses `import: false` which tells the build to\nskip bundling and rely entirely on the host providing React at runtime\nvia registerShared(). If the host fails to provide React, MFEs throw\na clear error: \"Shared module ''react'' must be provided by host\".\n\nBundle savings: ~12.6 kB (raw) / ~5 kB (gzip) per MFE.\nThis compounds linearly with the number of MFEs in the system.\n\nArchitectural principle: a single React instance is loaded once by the\nShell and shared with all MFEs through Module Federation''s runtime\nshared scope. No duplication, no version conflicts.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"3a02e1160566797ba6601e9200a0414fea3c6e2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/git/trees/3a02e1160566797ba6601e9200a0414fea3c6e2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/git/commits/80ef99d89d90e840bdd9b1e01a61694a0107acbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33881595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imenesesl","id":33881595,"login":"imenesesl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODgxNTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imenesesl/lyx/commit/80ef99d89d90e840bdd9b1e01a61694a0107acbc","node_id":"C_kwDOR00RMdoAKDgwZWY5OWQ4OWQ5MGU4NDBiZGQ5YjFlMDFhNjE2OTRhMDEwN2FjYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imenesesl/lyx/commit/b682a0a56239e0a4fec79b6bbca029b9022029bc","sha":"b682a0a56239e0a4fec79b6bbca029b9022029bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/commits/b682a0a56239e0a4fec79b6bbca029b9022029bc"}],"sha":"80ef99d89d90e840bdd9b1e01a61694a0107acbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/commits/80ef99d89d90e840bdd9b1e01a61694a0107acbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33881595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imenesesl","id":33881595,"login":"imenesesl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODgxNTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/commits/b682a0a56239e0a4fec79b6bbca029b9022029bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T00:37:19Z","email":"luismenesesep@gmail.com","name":"Luis Meneses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T00:37:19Z","email":"luismenesesep@gmail.com","name":"Luis Meneses"},"message":"fix: resolve duplicate React instances — registerShared + runtime alignment\n\nMFEs crashed with \"Cannot read properties of null (reading ''useState'')\"\nbecause the host Shell never registered React in the MF shared scope at\nbuild time (shared:{} to avoid the $m bug). The MF runtime loadShare()\nfell back to each MFE''s own bundled React, creating multiple instances.\n\nTwo-part fix:\n- Call registerShared() with loaded:true + get callback so the host''s\n  React is pre-registered before any MFE loads\n- Upgrade @module-federation/runtime to 2.3.0 to match the version\n  embedded by @module-federation/vite 1.13.6 in MFE bundles\n\nTests added:\n- 10 unit tests verifying init/registerShared args, singleton config,\n  lib callbacks, and idempotent initialization\n- 8 Playwright E2E tests detecting useState errors, MFE crashes, MIME\n  type failures, $m reference errors, and asserting visible MFE content\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"8867a26e7ef9b136c2467bfd5625db1e9f4ef88c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/git/trees/8867a26e7ef9b136c2467bfd5625db1e9f4ef88c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/git/commits/b682a0a56239e0a4fec79b6bbca029b9022029bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33881595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imenesesl","id":33881595,"login":"imenesesl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODgxNTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/imenesesl/lyx/commit/b682a0a56239e0a4fec79b6bbca029b9022029bc","node_id":"C_kwDOR00RMdoAKGI2ODJhMGE1NjIzOWUwYTRmZWM3OWI2YmJjYTAyOWI5MDIyMDI5YmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/imenesesl/lyx/commit/2066954e4969c48227e9df1b0e172f62f7f0c07b","sha":"2066954e4969c48227e9df1b0e172f62f7f0c07b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/commits/2066954e4969c48227e9df1b0e172f62f7f0c07b"}],"sha":"b682a0a56239e0a4fec79b6bbca029b9022029bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/commits/b682a0a56239e0a4fec79b6bbca029b9022029bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33881595?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/imenesesl","id":33881595,"login":"imenesesl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODgxNTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imenesesl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/commits/2066954e4969c48227e9df1b0e172f62f7f0c07b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T00:02:21Z","email":"luismenesesep@gmail.com","name":"Luis Meneses"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T00:02:21Z","email":"luismenesesep@gmail.com","name":"Luis Meneses"},"message":"refactor: remove local infrastructure layer — single resource model\n\nRemove MinIO and local MongoDB from the platform. All environments\n(local dev and production) now use the same cloud resources:\n- AWS S3 for MFE bundle storage (no more MinIO)\n- MongoDB Atlas for the database (no more local MongoDB)\n\nKey changes:\n- Remove minio dependency and dual storage code path from admin-api\n- Simplify config.ts: S3_BUCKET replaces 6 MINIO_* env vars\n- Remove mongodb/minio containers from docker-compose\n- Route /storage/ through SSR (which reads S3) instead of MinIO\n- Update platform.sh to require lyx aws login + MONGO_URI\n- Update nginx to proxy /storage/ to SSR instead of MinIO\n- Update CloudFormation, deploy-aws.sh, CI to use S3_BUCKET\n- Update all docs, skills, rules, and error knowledge base\n\nDevelopers use two AWS accounts (dev/prod) and switch with\nlyx aws login. No local infrastructure setup needed.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"e44a706cec4b2fc54242b014e41298e426463575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/imenesesl/lyx/git/trees/e44a706cec4b2fc54242b014e41298e426463575"},"url":"https://ap